      "fullPrompt": "Haman Nakhwanoi traditional Korean firework performance at night. Historic pavilion beside a calm dark lotus pond, hundreds of charcoal nakhwa sticks suspended above water, thousands of golden embers cascading in dense vertical curtains. Extreme foreground filled with large luminous golden bokeh sparks, creamy circular highlights, cinematic depth of field, anamorphic glow, realistic lens flare. Dark pond reflecting falling fire; reflections transforming into dancheong inspired cloud and lotus motifs, thin golden ornamental curves beneath rippling water. Within reflections, a Korean tiger emerges in elegant side profile - head, ears, muzzle, muscular shoulders, four legs, curved tail - formed only by luminous particles and broken reflections, edges dissolving into microscopic golden filaments, not solid. Pavilion silhouette softly lit by warm lanterns. Warm amber gold firelight, deep midnight blue atmosphere, subtle cyan in particles, atmospheric mist, realistic water ripples. 50mm f/2.0, photorealistic, no people, no text.",
