    {
      "id": "sub-1790860421651-91",
      "submissionNumber": "DH-IMG-092",
      "title": "「아직, 지키고 있다」",
      "category": "IMAGE",
      "submitterName": "김지수",
      "participantCategory": "일반인",
      "submitterAffiliation": "무직",
      "nationalHeritageName": "무령왕릉 석수(진묘수)",
      "baekjeRelated": "사용함",
      "description": "공주 무령왕릉에서 출토된 석수(진묘수)는 무덤의 널길에 놓여 왕과 왕비의 안식을 지키는 수호적 존재이다. 오랜 시간이 흐른 지금 우리 앞에 남아 있는 것은 작은 석조 유물이지만, 이 석수가 약 1,500년 동안 지켜온 것은 단순한 무덤이라는 공간만이 아니라 그 안에 잠든 사람과 백제라는 시대의 기억 전체가 아닐까 하는 질문에서 작품을 시작했다.\n\n작품에서는 실제 석수의 형태와 세월의 흔적을 중심에 두고, 그 뒤로 실제 크기를 압도하는 거대한 그림자를 드리웠다. 그림자 속에는 왕과 왕비를 암시하는 인물과 당시의 사람들, 강과 배, 건축과 자연 등 백제의 기억을 상징하는 풍경을 담았다. 이는 특정한 백제의 모습을 역사적 사실처럼 복원한 것이 아니라, 오늘날 남아 있는 유물이 품고 있는 보이지 않는 시간과 의미를 생성형 AI를 통해 시각적으로 재해석한 상상의 풍경이다.\n\n작은 석수와 거대한 그림자의 대비를 통해 국가유산은 단순히 과거에 남겨진 물질이 아니라, 수많은 시간과 사람의 기억을 현재까지 이어주는 존재임을 표현하고자 했다. 1,500년 전 맡겨진 임무는 아직 끝나지 않았다.",
      "aiTools": [
        "챗GPT"
      ],
      "postEditingUsage": "사용함",
      "postEditingDetails": "없음",
      "promptSummary": "",
      "fullPrompt": "Create a museum-quality, cinematic photorealistic artwork inspired by the Stone Guardian Beast (Seoksu / Jinnmyosu) excavated from the Tomb of King Muryeong in Gongju, Korea.\n\nCONCEPT:\n“Still Guarding” — a small surviving stone guardian casts an impossibly enormous shadow containing the memory of the Baekje era it has guarded for approximately 1,500 years.\n\nThe artwork is NOT a literal historical reconstruction.\nIt is a poetic contemporary reinterpretation of cultural heritage using generative AI.\n\n────────────────────────\n1. THE STONE GUARDIAN — MOST IMPORTANT\n────────────────────────\n\nIn the lower-left foreground, place the Stone Guardian Beast from the Tomb of King Muryeong.\n\nIts appearance must closely follow the supplied reference photograph.\n\nDO NOT redesign it into a Chinese guardian lion, foo dog, haetae, dragon, qilin, fantasy monster, or generic East Asian guardian statue.\n\nPreserve the distinctive archaeological appearance:\n\n- compact, heavy, low-standing body\n- four short, thick legs\n- disproportionately large head\n- broad blunt muzzle\n- slightly opened horizontal mouth\n- simple, primitive facial construction\n- rounded, bulky torso\n- carved curved decorative lines on the sides and back\n- small iron antler/horn structure attached to the top of the head\n- asymmetrical hand-carved appearance\n- visibly ancient stone surface\n- pale beige, gray and muted ochre coloration\n- erosion, chips, pores, scratches and irregularities caused by age\n- no polished stone\n- no decorative fantasy armor\n- no additional ornaments\n\nIt must look like an authentic excavated archaeological object,\nNOT a newly sculpted fantasy creature.\n\nThe guardian itself represents the tangible cultural heritage that has survived into the present.\n\n────────────────────────\n2. ENVIRONMENT\n────────────────────────\n\nPlace the guardian inside a restrained, dark architectural space inspired by an ancient tomb chamber.\n\nThe space must feel archaeological and believable rather than fantastical.\n\nUse aged dark masonry, stone flooring and subdued architectural details.\n\nDo NOT create a spectacular fantasy palace.\nDo NOT use excessive ornaments.\nDo NOT use glowing magical objects.\n\nA narrow opening on the far left allows natural late-afternoon sunlight to enter.\n\nThe light strikes the guardian from the left and creates a long shadow across the enormous wall behind it.\n\nFine dust particles may be visible naturally in the sunlight.\n\nLighting should feel physically plausible.\n\n────────────────────────\n3. THE IMPOSSIBLE SHADOW\n────────────────────────\n\nThis is the central visual idea.\n\nAlthough the real guardian is small, its shadow must be monumental.\n\nThe shadow occupies most of the right half of the 16:9 composition.\n\nAt first glance, the viewer should recognize the silhouette of an enormous guardian beast.\n\nThe shadow must clearly originate from the physical stone guardian.\n\nHowever, when viewed more closely, the dark interior of the shadow contains fragments of an imagined Baekje memory.\n\nThe historical imagery must exist ONLY INSIDE THE SHADOW.\n\nOutside the shadow, the wall remains ordinary and empty.\n\nInside the shadow subtly reveal:\n\n- a river suggesting the Geum River\n- several restrained ancient wooden boats\n- small human figures engaged in everyday life\n- modest wooden architecture\n- distant mountainous terrain\n- trees and natural landscape\n- traces of a settlement\n- bridges or river crossings\n- subtle silhouettes suggesting a royal couple\n\nThese elements should merge organically into the darkness of the shadow.\n\nThey must NOT look like a portal,\nmovie screen,\nphotograph,\ndigital projection,\nhologram,\nseparate painting,\nor literal window into the past.\n\nInstead, they should resemble memories gradually becoming visible within darkness.\n\nThe internal imagery should be monochromatic and subdued:\ncharcoal black,\ndark umber,\naged sepia,\nsoft warm gray.\n\nLow contrast.\nPartially obscured.\nSome areas almost disappear into the shadow.\n\nAvoid excessive microscopic detail.\n\nThe viewer should discover these elements gradually.\n\n────────────────────────\n4. VISUAL HIERARCHY\n────────────────────────\n\nThe image must work on two viewing distances.\n\nFROM FAR AWAY:\na small ancient stone guardian casting an impossibly huge guardian-shaped shadow.\n\nFROM CLOSE UP:\nan entire lost era quietly exists within that shadow.\n\nThe physical guardian should remain clearly readable but relatively small.\n\nThe monumental shadow should dominate the composition.\n\nCreate strong negative space.\n\nDo not fill every area with visual information.\n\nThe contrast between the small physical object and enormous intangible memory is essential.\n\n────────────────────────\n5. MEANING\n────────────────────────\n\nThe guardian represents what physically survived.\n\nThe shadow represents what cannot physically survive:\npeople,\nplaces,\ndaily life,\nmemory,\ntime,\nand cultural meaning.\n\nThe image should communicate:\n\n“A small artifact can contain a history much larger than itself.”\n\nand\n\n“The duty entrusted to this guardian 1,500 years ago has not yet ended.”\n\nThe guardian is no longer merely protecting a tomb.\n\nMetaphorically, it is protecting the memory of Baekje itself.\n\n────────────────────────\n6. PHOTOGRAPHIC REALISM\n────────────────────────\n\nMake the scene feel like an impossible moment captured by a real professional camera.\n\nNatural cinematic photography.\n\nFull-frame camera aesthetic.\n35–50mm lens.\nRealistic perspective.\nControlled depth of field.\nNatural optical falloff.\nSubtle film grain.\nPhysically plausible global illumination.\nAccurate contact shadows.\nReal stone microtexture.\nNatural atmospheric dust.\n\nAvoid the typical polished AI aesthetic.\n\nAvoid:\nhyper-sharp CGI,\nvideo-game rendering,\nfantasy concept-art appearance,\nexcessive HDR,\norange-and-teal grading,\noverly dramatic volumetric rays,\nperfect symmetry,\nartificial glowing edges,\nfloating particles everywhere,\noverdecorated architecture,\ngeneric Korean historical fantasy,\nChinese imperial architecture,\nJapanese architecture,\nJoseon palace aesthetics,\nfantasy pagodas,\nfantasy costumes,\nheroic fantasy atmosphere.\n\nThe emotional tone should be:\nquiet,\nsolemn,\nmysterious,\narchaeological,\ncontemplative,\ntimeless.\n\n────────────────────────\n7. COMPOSITION\n────────────────────────\n\nHorizontal 16:9 composition.\n\nFinal target:\n3840 × 2160 pixels.\n\nStone guardian:\nlower-left third.\n\nLight source:\nfar left.\n\nMassive shadow:\ncenter-right and upper-right.\n\nThe guardian and its shadow must have an obvious physical relationship.\n\nKeep the foreground dark and restrained.\n\nDo not place unnecessary foreground objects.\n\nDo not add museum labels, barriers, display cases, visitors, modern objects, typography, captions, logos, watermarks, or interface elements.\n\nNO TEXT ANYWHERE IN THE IMAGE.\n\nThe finished artwork should resemble a high-end contemporary cultural-heritage photography exhibition piece rather than an AI fantasy illustration.",
