      "fullPrompt": "A cinematic, photorealistic close-up scene inside an ancient Baekje-era brick tomb chamber \n(dark reddish-brown vaulted brick walls, simple and austere — no ornate carvings, no gold \naltars, no decorative statues, historically humble tomb architecture).\n\nAt the center, a dark grayish stone tablet (지석, a memorial stone slab) rests tilted on a \nlow stone base. The engraved characters are almost illegible — heavily eroded, shallow, \nblurred by 1,500 years of weathering, with only vague strokes visible rather than clear \nreadable text. Do NOT render sharp, clean, or legible characters.\n\nAbove the stone, fine glowing particles of warm amber light rise from the worn inscription \nand slowly reassemble in the air into the faint, translucent silhouette of a regal figure's \nface wearing an ancient crown — abstract and ethereal, like a memory returning, not a solid \nportrait.\n\nLighting: a single dramatic shaft of light from above illuminates the stone and the forming \nface, while the surrounding brick walls fade into deep shadow. Faint dust and mist catch the \nlight. A few candle flames flicker in the deep background, small and understated — not a \ngrand altar.\n\nMood: solemn, ancient, quiet — an archaeological and spiritual moment, not a fantasy palace \nscene. The stone's weathered texture and the tomb's brick simplicity are the visual anchors.\n\nStyle: ultra-realistic, cinematic photography, shallow depth of field, 16:9 wide composition, \nhigh detail on aged stone and worn carved texture, documentary-quality lighting.",
