      "fullPrompt": "1. 진묘수 캐릭터화\n\n[ Midjourney]\nPrompt:\nIf this creature were alive, please turn it into a cute animal-something with the vibe of a guardian spirit, like a cute character. --ar 1:1 --sref 2755991217 2323068368 --hd\n\nReference:\n무령왕릉 석수 이미지 사용 (출처: 국립공주박물관)\nAttach to Prompt, Style Reference 사용\n\n2. 진묘수 캐릭터 수정 및 보완\n\n[ChatGPT]\nPrompt:\n첨부한 사진의 캐릭터의 색상을 변경해줘. 몸통은 연한 노랑색, 갈기 무늬는 연한 분홍색, 뿔은 붉은색, 배부분만 동그랗게 녹색 빛으로, 오른쪽 안 다리 색상도 반드시 연한 노란색으로 자연스럽게 그림자 넣어서 표현해줘. 그림체와 색감 유지해줘. 글씨 없음.\n\n[Midjourney]\nPrompt:\nturn this creature turn into a cute animal-something with the vibe of a guardian spirit, like a cute character. The facing forward. --ar 1:1\n\nReference:\nAttach to Prompt, Image Prompts 사용\n\n3. 배경(박물관) 이미지 그림체 변경\n\n[ChatGPT]\nPrompt:\nUse the attached photograph as the primary visual reference for the location and composition.Transform the attached photograph of the National Gongju Museum in Gongju, Korea into a warm, charming hand-drawn illustration. Preserve the recognizable spatial composition and major architectural features of the actual museum shown in the reference image: the broad open plaza in the foreground, the modern museum building in the middle, the surrounding trees and wooded hills, the open blue sky, and the small circular green lawn area near the entrance where the real Jinmyosu stone guardian is displayed.The image should clearly feel like the present-day National Gongju Museum, not an imaginary historical palace or a generic museum. Keep the actual relationship between the museum building, plaza, trees, hills, and the Jinmyosu display area recognizable from the reference photograph.Do not reproduce the photograph literally. Reinterpret the location as a soft, charming hand-drawn illustration with natural imperfect lines, gentle textures, subtle watercolor and colored-pencil qualities, and a warm contemporary Korean illustration style.Use a calm and restrained color palette: soft sky blue, muted green, warm cream, pale gray, and gentle natural colors. Avoid excessive saturation or flashy colors.The atmosphere should be peaceful, friendly, and slightly nostalgic, as if the present-day museum has been remembered through a beautiful hand-drawn illustration.Leave enough open space in the foreground and around the museum entrance so that a cute illustrated Jinmyosu character can later be placed naturally into the scene, looking toward the modern Gongju landscape.No people, no text, no logos, no signs with readable lettering, no fantasy architecture, no ancient Baekje buildings, no historical reconstruction, no photorealistic rendering.Vertical composition, 9:16.\n\nReference:\n국립공주박물관 사이버 투어의 항공 사진 사용\n\n4. 배경 정리 및 구도 변경, 캐릭터 합성\n\n[ChatGPT]\nPrompt:\n중앙 아래에 있는 연두색 동그라미와 그위의 석상 모두 지워줘.\n16:9 비율로 변경! 여백은 \"국립공주박물관\" 모습과 주변 자연 환경으로 자연스럽게 채우기, 건물의 형태 유지. 글씨 없음, 그림체와 색감 유지.\n\n[Midjourney]\nPrompt:\nCreate the reference character flies up from the background. Zoom in 3/4 of the character's front is clearly visible, and zoom in to show them flying towards the screen, Strong central perspective, funnel-shaped composition, with the museum architecture, pathways, trees, and background elements gradually narrowing and converging toward a vanishing point behind the reference character . Keep the edges visually quiet and guide all visual lines toward the centered character. Dynamic 3D animation-like perspective, strong central focus. No text. --ar 16:9 --hd\n\nReference: 생성한 배경과 캐릭터 이미지\nAttach to Prompt 사용\n\n[ChatGPT]\nPrompt:\nUse the attached image as the exact composition reference.\nKeep the entire composition, strong perspective, dynamic forward motion, background distortion, and depth exactly as they are.\nOnly make two subtle changes: 1.Reduce the Jinmyosu character's size by approximately 10%. 2. Move the Jinmyosu slightly to the right, only a small amount.\nPreserve the original perspective and depth completely. The Jinmyosu must still appear close to the viewer and much larger than the museum in the background. Keep the dramatic foreshortening and 3/4 perspective of the character. Do not straighten, flatten, rebalance, or redesign the composition. Do not change the background perspective or camera angle. Preserve the Jinmyosu's exact appearance, colors, hand-drawn texture, proportions, facial expression, and dynamic pose. No new elements, no removed elements, no text, no yellow cast. 16:9\n\n5. 캐릭터 질감 최종 확정\n\n[ChatGPT]\nPrompt:\n첨부한 이미지에서 캐릭터만! 사실적인 그래픽으로 변경해줘. 배경은 그대로 두고, 캐릭터만 3d 느낌의 입체적이고 생생한 질감으로 만들어줘. 캐릭터의 눈에 빛나는 하얀색의 작은 점을 넣어서 생동감 있게 표현해줘, 동공은 그려 넣지마. 원본 캐릭터의 생김새와 형태는 반드시 유지, 원본 캐릭터의 크기와 위치는 절대 고정, 캐릭터의 질감만 입체적이고 매끈하게 변경. 배경은 절대 건들지 않기. 텍스트 없음. 16:9",
      "processCaptureDriveUrl": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=19oHLbIDrUF0K5dR4NxFuygNYhEymWu4B, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1xxwdlEbkHBqJNWiIvNHFDprvBduHS-eE, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1T9Ehyxzqlq0ckkp7bXkVpW7AEUd9cQAL, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gJj49RdYf-X6PAXjYt-xFreUn4dMAtIz, https://drive.google.com/open?id=19ERPg2ME6xG5EzcS3v-fEcKzn-jB_oH6",
