      "fullPrompt": "[1차 생성 프롬프트]\n\nAward-winning conceptual digital heritage artwork, cinematic 16:9.\n\nA surreal cross-section of Gongsanseong Fortress in Gongju, Korea, showing TWO ERAS IN ONE IMAGE.\n\nABOVE THE GROUND:\npresent-day Gongsanseong Fortress stretches peacefully across the mountain ridge at dawn, surrounded by Korean mountains and soft mist, realistic and understated.\n\nBELOW THE GROUND:\nthe earth is dramatically opened like an archaeological cross-section, revealing a vast hidden world of Baekje memories preserved beneath the fortress for 1,500 years.\n\nInside the underground layers are elegant fragments inspired by authentic Baekje heritage from Gongju: delicate gold ornaments from the Tomb of King Muryeong, Baekje lotus patterns, ancient pottery fragments, bricks and architectural patterns.\n\nBut the buried heritage is not simply archaeological.\n\nThousands of ancient fragments are transforming into tiny luminous DIGITAL PIXELS and DATA PARTICLES.\n\nA spectacular vertical stream of golden and turquoise data rises from the buried Baekje world through the layers of earth and reconnects with Gongsanseong Fortress above.\n\nThe transition from ancient artifact to digital information must be visually obvious and breathtaking.\n\nThe artwork symbolizes:\n1500 YEARS OF BAEKJE MEMORY\n→ ARCHAEOLOGICAL DISCOVERY\n→ DIGITAL RESTORATION\n→ ETERNAL PRESERVATION.\n\nStrong visual contrast between dark ancient earth below and luminous dawn above.\n\nSophisticated Korean aesthetic, archaeological mystery, contemporary digital art, poetic but intellectually powerful, museum exhibition quality, dramatic scale, unusual composition, emotional visual storytelling, photorealistic textures combined with fine-art surrealism, prestigious international art competition quality.\n\nNOT a tourism poster.\nNOT decorative flowers.\nNO giant crown.\nNO fantasy castle.\nNO random jewelry.\nNO generic Korean palace.\nNO people.\nNO text.\nNO letters.\nNO logo.\nNO watermark.\nNO Chinese architecture.\nNO Japanese architecture.\n\n\n[최종 Remix 프롬프트]\n\nKeep this exact composition and archaeological cross-section concept.\n\nRefine the central transformation into a sophisticated digital heritage visualization. Ancient Baekje fragments and patterns should gradually dissolve into thousands of extremely fine golden and turquoise pixels, geometric data particles, and subtle holographic fragments as they rise toward Gongsanseong Fortress.\n\nMake the transformation elegant, complex and organic — like ancient memory becoming digital information — NOT a simple beam of light and NOT large floating cubes.\n\nPreserve the underground roots, archaeological layers, Baekje artifacts, Gongsanseong Fortress, realistic landscape and current color palette.\n\nMake the underground Baekje heritage slightly more mysterious and atmospheric, with subtle illumination emerging from the buried artifacts.\n\nContemporary museum-quality digital art, intellectually powerful, poetic, sophisticated, award competition quality.\n\nNo text, no letters, no crown, no fantasy jewelry, no sci-fi portal.",
