      "description": "백제 금동대향로에 피어오르는 향을 과거와 현재의 한국을 연결하는 매개체로 재해석한 작품입니다.\n\n향로에 새겨진 산과 폭포, 봉황·용·학·사슴이 향과 함께 살아나 하나의 풍경으로 확장되며, 그 흐름을 따라 경복궁, 남산서울타워, 롯데월드타워가 자연스럽게 이어지도록 표현했습니다.\n\n이는 백제의 세계에서 시작된 한국의 문화와 자연이 역사를 지나 오늘날의 한국으로 이어지고 있음을 시각적으로 나타낸 작품입니다.",
      "aiTools": [
        "ChatGPT",
        "Midjourney"
      ],
      "postEditingUsage": "사용함",
      "postEditingDetails": "없음",
      "promptSummary": "",
      "fullPrompt": "Create a vertical 2:3 surreal contemporary Korean heritage fantasy artwork. In the lower center foreground, place a highly detailed Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner, faithfully preserving its original recognizable form, intricate mountain-shaped lid, phoenix finial, lotus-shaped body, and dragon-shaped base, rendered in dark warm rose-bronze metallic tones.\n\nFrom the incense burner, long translucent peach-pink and ivory incense smoke flows upward and outward like silk ribbons, water, mist, and clouds, becoming the main visual element that connects the entire scene.\n\nSurround the incense burner with a vast fantastical Korean landscape of dramatic layered mountains, cascading waterfalls, winding rivers, Korean pine trees, pink flowering trees, lotus flowers, plum blossoms, and drifting flower petals. The carved mountain world of the incense burner should visually expand into the surrounding landscape.\n\nInclude recognizable elements of the incense burner’s world: a large elegant phoenix in the upper left, a dragon emerging from the incense burner, a white crane and deer on the right, naturally integrated into the landscape.\n\nIn the background, create a visual transition from ancient Korea to modern Korea. Place Gyeongbokgung Palace on the left, naturally surrounded by mountains and flowers. Place N Seoul Tower near the upper center-right, rising from the mountain landscape. Place Lotte World Tower clearly visible in the far upper right, with a modern Seoul skyline and Han River bridges behind it. These three landmarks must be recognizable but organically blended into the landscape rather than appearing as separate objects.\n\nUse a luminous pastel color palette of peach, coral pink, blush pink, soft cream, sky blue, mint green, jade, warm ivory, and subtle gold. Bright, dreamy, elegant, highly detailed, sophisticated Korean fantasy art, contemporary reinterpretation of traditional Korean heritage, painterly 3D-like depth, cinematic atmosphere, rich layered composition, full-bleed poster, intricate details throughout.\n\nThe overall visual narrative should communicate “the world of Baekje awakening through incense and transforming into Korea of the past and present.”\n\nNo people, no text, no logos, no extra landmarks, no dark atmosphere, no generic fantasy city, no empty background.",
      "processCaptureDriveUrl": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=1WSDJAv7TdcqY0VhIAY_otPptTQchh5U6",
