      "promptSummary": "",
      "fullPrompt": "사용한 프롬프트 (명령어)\n2-1. 캐릭터·소품 레퍼런스 시트\nA인물(심청) 시트 — Seedream 5.0 Pro, 2K, 16:9\nPhotorealistic character reference sheet on a plain flat neutral grey studio background. Character A: a slender adult Korean woman with a calm, gentle expression, natural skin texture, dark hair in a low braided bun tied with a red ribbon, wearing a vivid vermilion-red traditional hanbok with a long flowing skirt. Real studio lighting, photorealistic skin and fabric. THREE panels side by side: (1) full-body front view, (2) full-body back view, (3) large face and shoulders close-up, front. Same face, hairstyle and outfit in every panel. No scenery, no text.\n\nB인물(심봉사) 시트 — GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, high, 2K, 16:9\nPhotorealistic character reference sheet on a plain flat neutral grey studio background. Character B: an elderly thin Korean man with a weathered kind face, eyes closed as a blind man, short grey beard, wearing a worn off-white hemp hanbok and a black horsehair gat hat, holding a long wooden walking cane. Real studio lighting, photorealistic skin and textures. THREE panels side by side: (1) full-body front view, (2) full-body back view, (3) large face close-up, front. Same face and outfit in every panel. No scenery, no text.\n\n소품 시트 (배 / 연꽃 봉오리 / 만개 연꽃) — Seedream 5.0 Pro, 스타일 레퍼런스 첨부\nProp reference sheet, three panels side by side over a soft teal graphic landscape backdrop in the style of @Image1: (1) a photorealistic traditional Korean wooden merchant ship with hemp sails, (2) a giant photorealistic pink lotus bud whose lower half dissolves into a vivid graphic blue-green mountain landscape with waterfalls and pine trees drawn in flat wavy contour lines, (3) a fully bloomed photorealistic lotus with a coral, yellow and turquoise graphic landscape growing inside its petals. No text.\n\n2-2. 앵커 이미지 7장 — GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, high, 2K, 16:9\n레퍼런스: @Image1 스타일 이미지 / @Image2 A인물 시트 / @Image3 B인물 시트 / @Image4 소품 시트\n공통 앞부분\n@Image1 sets the STYLE only: a vivid flat graphic painted landscape (layered wavy contour mountains, turquoise, coral, yellow, pine green, stylized rivers) that fills the ENTIRE frame edge to edge — no white space, no blank background. Real people and props are PHOTOREALISTIC with real lighting and soft contact shadows, creating strong contrast against the graphic world. @Image2 is the EXACT Character A (face, hair, vermilion hanbok). @Image3 is the EXACT Character B (face, gat, worn hemp hanbok, cane). @Image4 shows the EXACT props. No text.\n\nA1 강변 새벽\nSCENE: dawn riverside. Character A and Character B walk side by side along a wide turquoise graphic river bank, Character A gently holding Character B's arm to guide him. Sky is a dawn peach-to-yellow gradient. Both figures small in the lower third of the frame.\n\nA2 마을 쌀자루\nSCENE: a graphic thatched-roof village beneath coral mountains. Character A stands beside a pile of photorealistic burlap rice sacks (offering rice), resolute, seen in three-quarter view from behind.\n\nA3 인당수 밤바다\nSCENE: night sea of Indangsu. Layered swirling graphic waves in deep indigo and turquoise under a night sky with a pale moon. The photorealistic wooden ship floats on the graphic waves; Character A stands at the bow, her red skirt billowing in the wind.\n\nA4 수중\nSCENE: a dreamlike blue underwater realm drawn as flowing graphic wave contours with stylized seaweed and fish. Character A drifts serenely, floating like a petal, her red skirt spread open like a flower, soft light rays falling from above. Calm, peaceful, poetic.\n\nA5 연꽃 봉오리 (재생성본)\nSCENE: a mystical underwater valley, graphic coral reefs and layered wavy contour sea-mountains in turquoise and coral, soft light rays from above, schools of small fish. A giant photorealistic pink lotus bud rises in the center, a graphic blue-green mountain landscape with waterfall visible inside its lower half. A small Character A stands before it, looking up in awe. NO buildings of any kind: no palaces, no pagodas, no pavilions, no columns, no Chinese or Western architecture — nature only.\n\nA6 만개 연꽃\nSCENE: a giant photorealistic pink lotus in full bloom on a graphic sea surface under a golden sky. Inside its open petals lies a coral and yellow graphic landscape, and Character A stands at its center, reborn and radiant.\n\nA7 아침 강변\nSCENE: the same wide turquoise graphic river bank in bright morning light, now lined with clusters of photorealistic pink lotus blossoms along the river. Character B stands leaning on his cane, facing toward the lotuses, small in the lower third of the frame.\n\n2-3. 영상 — Seedance 2.5 (Omni Reference, 30초 × 2, 16:9, 1080p, 오디오 생성 ON)\nPart 1 (0~30초) — end frame: Part 1 초안의 마지막 프레임 / 레퍼런스: A·B 시트, 앵커 A1·A2·A3\n[Reference Map]\n@Image1 = Character A identity (face, braided hair with red ribbon, vermilion hanbok). @Image2 = Character B identity (elderly blind man: face, black gat, worn hemp hanbok, wooden cane). @Image3 = dawn riverside set. @Image4 = village with rice sacks set. @Image5 = night sea with wooden ship set. Sets define environment and palette only; do not copy exact compositions. The end frame is pinned: the final shot must land exactly on it.\n\n[Generation Goal]\nA 30-second emotional sequence: Character A leaves her blind father and gives herself to the sea — sorrowful yet dignified. Fast-paced cinematic editing, multi-angle coverage, high immersion.\n\n[Global Direction]\nPhotorealistic people and props with real lighting inside a vivid flat graphic painted world (layered wavy contour mountains, turquoise, coral, yellow, pine green). The graphic world moves constantly: rivers flow, contour lines ripple, petals and mist drift. Emotion shown through body movement, not exaggerated faces. Hard cuts between angles, except one marked transformation transition.\n\n[0-5s | Dawn riverside] Wide shot: A guides B along the turquoise river, holding his arm. Cut to side profile: she glances at his face, eyes wet, then looks ahead and steadies her breath. Cut to close-up: her hand tightens on his hemp sleeve, trembling slightly, then slowly lets go.\n[5-6s | MATCH CUT] Hard cut from her hand on his sleeve to the same framing: her hand now resting on a rough burlap rice sack, same position, same size — a graphic match cut, no morphing.\n[6-14s | Village] Low angle: A stands beside photoreal rice sacks in a thatched village, back straight. Cut to over-shoulder: she looks back toward the road where her father went, holds a beat, then turns away with lifted chin.\n[14-17s | TRANSITION] The coral mountains behind her rise and curl into giant indigo waves, sky darkening to night, a moon rising — the village transforms into the open sea; the ground under her feet becomes the ship's bow.\n[17-25s | Night sea] Wide aerial: the wooden ship tossed on graphic waves under the full moon. Cut to medium from the front: A at the bow, skirt and ribbon whipping in the wind, hands clasped, eyes closed in prayer. Cut to extreme close-up: one tear, then her eyes open, calm and resolute.\n[25-30s | Into the sea] Side angle: she steps forward off the bow. Camera follows her down through the surface in one motion; her red skirt blooms open like a flower as she drifts in soft light rays among graphic coral. Land exactly on the pinned end frame.\n\n[Maintain Consistency]\nCharacter A and B match @Image1 and @Image2 exactly in every shot. One Character A only. People stay photoreal; the world stays flat graphic.\n\n[Audio]\nNO BGM ONLY SFX. Flowing river and dawn birds, footsteps on sand, rustle of hemp cloth; village wind and burlap rustle; rising wind, crashing waves, creaking wood and flapping sail; a splash, then muffled underwater ambience with soft bubbles. No voice, no dialogue.\n\n[Negative Constraints]\nNo text, no buildings other than thatched village houses, no pagodas, no extra people, no crossfade or blur dissolve, no teleporting, no flicker.\n\nPart 2 (30~60초) — start frame: Part 1과 동일한 프레임 / 레퍼런스: A·B 시트, 앵커 A5·A6·A7\n[Reference Map]\n@Image1 = Character A identity (face, braided hair with red ribbon, vermilion hanbok). @Image2 = Character B identity (elderly blind man: face, black gat, worn hemp hanbok, wooden cane). @Image3 = underwater lotus-bud valley set. @Image4 = full-bloom lotus under golden sky set. @Image5 = morning riverside with lotus clusters set. Sets define environment and palette only; do not copy exact compositions. The start frame is pinned.\n\n[Generation Goal]\nA 30-second sequence of rebirth: Character A descends into a hidden valley, is reborn in a giant lotus, and her presence returns to her father as lotuses blooming along the river — serene, luminous, dignified. Fast-paced multi-angle editing, high immersion.\n\n[Global Direction]\nPhotorealistic people and props with real lighting inside a vivid flat graphic painted world (layered wavy contour lines, turquoise, coral, yellow, pine green). Constant motion: currents, fish, light rays, drifting petals. Hard cuts between angles, except the two marked physical transitions.\n\n[0-5s | Underwater drift] Continue exactly from the start frame with real underwater physics from the very first moment: loose strands of her hair and the red ribbon float slowly; her skirt undulates up and down with buoyancy; small bubbles rise from her sleeves and collar; rippling caustic light from the surface dances across her face and hanbok; suspended particles drift past the lens. Slow, weightless, slow-motion movement. Cut to low angle from below: light rays behind her silhouette as she sinks.\n[5-9s | TRANSITION 1 - through the water layers] She sinks past the camera; the camera keeps descending below her, through stacked layers of flat graphic wave contours like a sea of clouds. The layers physically part and open, revealing the coral valley and the giant lotus bud below — one continuous descending move, no dissolve.\n[9-14s | Lotus bud] Wide shot: A lands softly on the sandy floor before the giant photoreal pink lotus bud rising from the coral, no buildings anywhere. Cut to close-up: she looks up, reaches out, fingertips touch the petal. Cut to profile: she closes her eyes, a gentle breath, acceptance on her face.\n[14-20s | Bloom] Circling crane shot: the bud opens, petals unfolding in slow powerful motion, lifting her upward as water falls away; the lotus surges above the surface into a golden sky. Cut to frontal medium: A stands tall at the center of the bloom, calm, radiant, dignified.\n[20-23s | TRANSITION 2] Pink petals physically sweep across and fill the lens, then pull away to reveal the morning river — a physical petal wipe, not a dissolve.\n[23-30s | Morning riverside] Wide shot: clusters of photoreal pink lotuses bloom along the turquoise river. Cut to medium from behind: B stands leaning on his cane, head tilting toward the flowers as a soft breeze carries petals past him. Final close-up: his weathered face, a faint trembling smile. Hold.\n\n[Maintain Consistency]\nCharacters match @Image1 and @Image2 exactly. Only one Character A; she does not appear in the final riverside scene. People photoreal, world flat graphic.\n\n[Audio]\nNO BGM ONLY SFX. Muffled underwater ambience and rising bubbles; deep water rumble as the camera descends through the layers; a soft low resonance as the bud rises; petals unfolding and water rushing off; morning river flow, birdsong, a cane tapping on stone, a gentle breeze. No voice, no dialogue.\n\n[Negative Constraints]\nNo text, no buildings, no pagodas, no pavilions, no extra people, no crossfade or blur dissolve, no teleporting, no flicker.",
      "processCaptureDriveUrl": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=1fZ2gMEqLSGh1HB_GOaW3my_3AUyaUSK0",
