      "fullPrompt": "[이미지 생성 - Midjourney]\n\n1. 분청사기 병\n(1차) 15th century Korean buncheong bottle, pear shaped body with slender flaring neck, uneven creamy white slip with visible brush application and subtle discoloration, one large fish painted across the body in dark iron pigment, rough and rapid brushwork with uneven line weight, loosely crosshatched scales drawn quickly, curling vine scrolls, dense crackle across the glaze, small kiln blemishes and iron specks, plain neutral background, soft directional light, museum object photography --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 25 --no perfect smooth polished symmetrical digital clean\n(2차, 1차 결과를 이미지 프롬프트로 사용) Korean buncheong bottle with round belly and long slender neck, full bottle visible with the mouth rim inside the frame, floating in pitch black empty void, single soft light from the left, cream white crackled glaze, one large fish in rough black iron brushstrokes --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 25 --iw 1.5 --no museum wall table pedestal shadow label background crop\n(3차, 2차 결과를 이미지 프롬프트로 사용) the same bottle, pure black background, nothing else in the frame --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 25 --iw 2 --no light beam spotlight glow haze table floor shadow museum wall\n\n2. 수묵 계룡산\n(1차) Korean ink wash painting of Gyeryongsan, rocky ridge filling the lower half of the frame, jagged peaks with visible rock texture, dark ink on the peaks, mist below, empty sky above --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 50 --no color red seal stamp signature text vertical cliffs chinese style scroll border frame margin\n(2차, 1차 결과를 이미지 프롬프트로 사용) same painting, add a few small birds flying in the empty sky, drawn in quick ink strokes, small and distant --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 50 --iw 2 --no color red seal stamp signature text border frame margin\n\n3. 수묵 공산성 (계룡산 이미지를 스타일 레퍼런스로 사용)\nKorean ink wash painting, a low stone fortress wall winding along a small forested hill beside a wide calm river, a simple Korean wooden pavilion with a low gently curved tiled roof on the wall, mist, empty sky above --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 50 --no color red seal stamp text high mountains steep cliffs chinese pagoda upturned eaves great wall border frame margin\n\n4. 먹방울이 맺힌 붓\na traditional East Asian calligraphy brush hanging vertically, tip pointing straight down, a single heavy drop of black ink swelling at the very tip about to fall, flat solid chroma key green background, centered, empty space below the brush --ar 16:9 --style raw --s 25 --no hand arm person shadow reflection gradient text\n\n\n[영상 생성 - Higgsfield]\n\n5. 분청사기 균열 진입 (Seedance 2.5 / 10초 / 1080p / 시작 이미지: 분청사기 병)\n0-3s: wide shot of the entire bottle against a pure black background. the camera slowly begins a smooth dolly-in. exactly one single thin crack on the glaze starts glowing very faintly with soft white light from within. all the other crackle lines stay dark and unlit.\n3-7s: the shot tightens into a medium close-up of the bottle's body. the camera keeps dollying in steadily toward that one glowing crack. it grows brighter. still only this one crack glows, nothing else.\n7-10s: extreme close-up of the single glowing crack, centered in frame. the crack and the surrounding dark crackle texture fill the entire frame. no bottle silhouette or background visible. the light from inside this one crack is clearly visible.\nonly one crack glows at any time. static subject, no camera shake, no color shift, no text.\n\n6. 빛으로 덮이는 전환 (Seedance 2.5 / 5번 영상 5초 연장 / 1080p)\nthe light inside the single glowing crack grows rapidly brighter and brighter until it floods the entire frame and everything turns to pure white. the camera keeps pushing forward into the light. no camera shake, no color shift, no text.\n\n7. 먹방울 낙하 (Seedance 2.5 / 5초 / 1080p / 시작 이미지: 먹방울 붓)\nthe swelling black ink drop detaches from the brush tip and falls straight down, landing at the center of the frame where it flattens and disappears into the surface. after the drop lands, the brush slowly lifts upward and leaves the frame through the top, leaving the background clean and empty. static camera, no hand, no ripples, no splash, no ink marks left behind, no text.\n\n8. 수묵 계룡산 (Seedance 2.5 / 10초 / 1080p / 시작 이미지: 수묵 계룡산)\nmist drifts slowly between the peaks and a few ink birds flap their wings and glide across the sky. the mountains stay completely still. keep the black and white ink wash painting style throughout. no color, no realistic footage, static camera, no text.\n\n9. 수묵 공산성 (Seedance 2.5 / 10초 / 1080p / 시작 이미지: 수묵 공산성)\nmist drifts slowly around the fortress wall and the pavilion, and the river below flows gently. the wall and the buildings stay completely still. keep the black and white ink wash painting style throughout. no color, no realistic footage, static camera, no text.\n\n10. 공산성이 먹가루로 흩날림 (Seedance 2.5 / 9번 영상 5초 연장 / 1080p)\nthe ink wash painting begins to dissolve: the black ink lifts off the paper and breaks apart into countless fine particles of soot, drifting and swirling away to the right as if carried by wind. the fortress and the mountains gradually disappear into the drifting ink dust, leaving empty white paper behind. black and white ink wash style, no color, static camera, no text.\n\n11. 병이 흩어지는 장면 - 편집 시 역재생하여 사용 (Kling 3.0 / 10초 / pro / 시작 이미지: 분청사기 병, 끝 이미지: 10번 영상 마지막 프레임)\nthe ceramic bottle shatters into countless fine particles of black ink dust. the particles lift off and swirl away in the air, scattering outward, until the bottle has completely dissolved and only bare paper remains. continuous particle motion throughout, static camera, no text.",
