      "fullPrompt": "[MAIN CHARACTER FIXED PROMPT]\n\nThe exact same 20–22-year-old Korean female protagonist throughout the entire video. Soft oval-shaped face, large dark brown eyes, small natural nose, soft lips, clear fair skin, gentle youthful appearance. Long, straight dark brown hair reaching below the collarbone, soft see-through bangs, slim natural body proportions. She wears an ivory knit sweater, light blue long skirt, brown leather shoulder bag, and white sneakers. Her face, eyes, nose, lips, skin tone, hairstyle, hair length, bangs, body proportions, age, clothing, shoes, and shoulder bag must remain exactly identical in every scene. Do not redesign, replace, or reinterpret the character.\n\n2D HAND-DRAWN CINEMATIC ANIME FILM STYLE. Detailed hand-drawn anime character design, painted 2D backgrounds, cinematic anime lighting, soft hand-painted shadows, natural facial expressions and movement, emotional Japanese animated movie aesthetic. 2D ONLY. NOT LIVE ACTION. NOT PHOTOREALISTIC. NOT 3D. NOT CGI.\n\n[BAEKJE BOY FIXED PROMPT]\n\nThe exact same 13-year-old Korean boy whenever he appears. Soft youthful face, warm dark brown eyes, small natural nose, gentle expression, short straight black hair slightly covering his forehead, slim teenage body. He wears simple historically inspired Baekje-era clothing in beige and deep navy blue. His face, eyes, hairstyle, hair length, body proportions, age, and clothing must remain exactly identical in every scene where he appears. 2D cinematic historical anime style. NOT LIVE ACTION. NOT PHOTOREALISTIC. NOT 3D.\n\n[SCENE 01 — 낯선 편지]\n\nA rainy present-day Gongju setting. The same young Korean woman walks slowly along a wet stone path near a historic area. Wide shot from behind, then a gentle side camera movement. She suddenly notices a small old paper on the ground, stops, bends down, and picks it up. She looks at the old letter with curiosity and confusion. Close-up of the paper showing mysterious old writing. Gentle rain, wet stone, gray sky, subtle wind, quiet mysterious atmosphere. Slow cinematic dolly-in. 2D hand-drawn cinematic anime film.\n\n[SCENE 02 — 천 년 전의 글]\n\nContinue directly with the exact same 2D anime girl. She holds the same old letter and slowly opens it. The writing on the paper begins to glow with mysterious golden light. Golden particles rise from the letter and surround her. Raindrops become suspended in the air and the wind suddenly stops. The girl looks surprised and amazed. The golden light becomes brighter and fills the screen. The modern environment dissolves into golden particles, creating a magical transition toward an ancient world. Smooth cinematic camera rotation and slow movement. Maintain exactly the same anime character design. 2D hand-drawn cinematic anime only. No live action, no photorealism, no 3D.\n\n[SCENE 03 — 그 아이]\n\nThe same anime girl opens her eyes in an ancient Baekje-era city. Traditional architecture, stone walls, wooden houses, merchants, children, and boats along the Geum River. She looks around in shock and wonder. She encounters the exact same 13-year-old Baekje boy holding the same old letter. Cinematic two-shot of the girl and boy. Warm sunlight, historical fantasy atmosphere, detailed 2D hand-drawn anime backgrounds. The boy looks at her gently and speaks: “혹시… 네가 이걸 발견했니?” Maintain exactly the same appearance of both characters.\n\n[SCENE 04 — 전하지 못한 마음]\n\nThe same girl and the same Baekje boy sit together overlooking the Geum River. The boy holds the old letter and looks nostalgic and slightly sad. Close-up of his emotional expression. He says: “언젠가 누군가 이걸 읽어주면 좋겠다고 생각했어.” The girl listens quietly, then smiles gently and says: “그럼 내가 전해줄게.” The boy looks surprised and then smiles warmly. Warm sunlight reflecting on the river, gentle breeze, emotional close-ups, cinematic 2D historical anime.\n\n[SCENE 05 — 시간이 흐르다]\n\nThe same Baekje boy gently gives the old letter to the same girl. She receives it with both hands. Golden particles begin to appear and time rapidly passes around them. People move quickly, daylight changes into night, and the seasons transition through spring, summer, autumn, and winter. The boy gradually becomes distant and transparent. The girl reaches toward him and cries: “잠깐만!” The boy gives her a gentle final smile and dissolves into golden particles. The girl remains alone holding the letter. Dramatic emotional time-lapse, flowing seasons, cinematic camera movement, beautiful 2D hand-drawn anime.\n\n[SCENE 06 — 현재]\n\nThe same anime girl slowly opens her eyes and realizes she is back in the present. The rain has stopped and the stone walkway is quiet and wet. She looks down at her hands and realizes the letter is no longer there. She looks around in confusion and searches briefly. She slowly turns her head toward something outside the frame. The camera follows her gaze but does not reveal what she sees yet. Soft natural daylight, quiet mysterious atmosphere, slow cinematic camera movement, detailed 2D hand-drawn anime.\n\n[SCENE 07 — 천 년 동안 자란 것]\n\nThe same girl discovers a huge ancient tree. The tree has a massive trunk, deep roots, and wide branches. Warm sunlight passes through the leaves while a gentle breeze moves the branches. The girl looks at the tree with surprise and emotion. The camera moves slowly from behind her toward the base of the tree. A small old stone with a faint historical symbol is visible near the roots. She approaches it and gently reaches toward it. The symbol glows softly and she smiles. Golden-hour lighting, subtle magical realism, emotional 2D cinematic anime.\n\n[SCENE 08 — 천 년의 기억]\n\nThe same girl stands beneath the enormous tree. The camera begins behind her and slowly pulls backward. The girl and tree gradually become part of a wide view of Gongju, the fortress, and the Geum River. Brief transparent golden memories of the ancient world appear over the present landscape: old buildings, people, and boats. The memories slowly dissolve into golden particles. The same Baekje boy briefly appears beneath the tree and smiles warmly at the girl. She turns toward him. The boy gently dissolves into golden light. The camera continues pulling back to reveal the girl, tree, fortress, and river together in a wide cinematic composition. Golden sunset light. Emotional final scene. Leave clean visual space in the center for the ending title.\n\nFinal title:\n“천 년의 기억,\n오늘 다시 피어나다.”\n\n2D HAND-DRAWN CINEMATIC ANIME FILM STYLE ONLY. No live action, no photorealism, no 3D, no CGI.\n\n[COMMON NEGATIVE PROMPT]\n\ndifferent character, different face, face change, face distortion, different hairstyle, short hair, different hair color, different eye color, different clothes, different outfit, different body proportions, different age, character redesign, character replacement, duplicate character, extra main character, distorted hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, deformed body, bad anatomy, 3D character, 3D animation, CGI, live action, photorealistic human, realistic human skin, western cartoon, chibi, plastic skin, low quality, blurry face, flickering face, unstable character design, changing costume, changing hairstyle",
