      "fullPrompt": "① ChatGPT에 요청한 프롬프트 / 제작 지시\n\n전체 영상 방향\n\n금동대향로를 주제로 영상 제작. 금동대향로 사진처럼 어둡고 메탈 느낌으로 구성하고, 향로 안의 구성요소를 실제처럼 금색 메탈 질감으로 표현한다. 전체 영상에서 금동대향로 특유의 청동·금속 질감을 유지한다.\n\n씬 구성 변경\n\n금동대향로 몸통부터 프레임을 시작해서 말을 타고 활을 쏘는 사냥꾼, 도공이 토기를 빚는 장면, 백제 마을 거리와 시장, 백제 기와집에서 백제 여인이 몸을 치장하는 모습, 백제 성과 궁, 백제 여왕이 금제 관식을 쓰고 왕위에 앉아있는 모습, 마지막으로 5인의 악사로 연결한다.\n\n사냥꾼 씬\n\n금동대향로 몸통에서 시작해서 향로 안으로 들어가는 장면을 너무 오래 보여주지 않고 사냥꾼까지 이어지게 한다. 말을 타고 활을 쏘는 사냥꾼을 보여주며 모든 요소는 금동대향로와 같은 금속 질감으로 표현한다.\n\n도공 씬\n\n활 장면에서 자연스럽게 이어서 도공이 토기를 빚는 모습을 보여준다. 도자기 자체를 갑자기 확대하지 말고 카메라가 하나의 장면을 훑고 지나가듯 도공의 생활 모습을 보여준다. 도공과 토기, 주변 환경 모두 금동대향로와 같은 청동·메탈 질감으로 표현한다.\n\n백제 마을 씬\n\n도공 다음 장면에서 백제 마을과 시장을 보여준다. 카메라가 한 장면을 촬영하고 지나가듯 자연스럽게 이동하며 백제 사람들의 일상과 시장의 모습을 보여준다. 모든 것을 금동대향로와 같은 메탈 질감으로 통일한다.\n\n여인 씬\n\n마을에서 백제 기와집으로 자연스럽게 이동하고, 기와집 안에서 백제 여인이 자신의 모습을 가꾸는 장면을 보여준다. 여인과 집, 가구, 장신구, 의복까지 모두 금동대향로 같은 청동 메탈 질감으로 표현한다.\n\n궁 씬\n\n문틈으로 백제 여인이 보이는 마지막 장면에서 시작한다. 여인이 문을 닫는 것이 아니라 문이 저절로 닫히도록 하고, 문이 닫힌 뒤 갑자기 장면이 바뀌지 않게 카메라가 실제로 뒤로 빠져나와 궁으로 이동한다. 궁으로 이동할 때 모든 것이 메탈이어야 하며, 풀이나 자연적인 질감이 보이지 않도록 한다. 땅도 백제 고분과 같은 고대적인 형태를 가지되 금속으로 표현한다. 궁은 아래에서 위로 올려다보며 웅장하게 보여준다. 하늘은 검은색이고 은은한 금빛이 내려오도록 한다.\n\n여왕 씬\n\n궁의 문에서 시작해서 문이 자연스럽게 열리고 카메라가 궁 안으로 들어간다. 카메라 이동이 중간에 끊기거나 페이드인·페이드아웃되지 않게 한다. 궁 안에는 백제 여왕이 금제 관식을 머리에 쓰고 왕좌에 앉아 아래를 내려다보며, 주변에는 여러 신하들이 서 있도록 한다. 여왕과 신하, 왕좌, 궁 내부의 모든 요소를 금동대향로와 같은 청동·금속 질감으로 통일한다.\n\n여왕 → 악사 씬\n\n여왕 장면에서 카메라를 여왕 쪽으로 더 확대하고, 여왕의 뒤쪽으로 카메라가 넘어가면서 궁 밖으로 빠져나온다. 페이드나 갑작스러운 장면 전환 없이 실제 카메라 이동으로 궁 밖의 산으로 이어진다. 산과 주변 환경 역시 모두 금속 질감으로 표현한다. 산으로 이동하면서 자연스럽게 5인의 악사가 등장하고, 마지막 프레임에는 5악사가 모두 보이게 한다.\n\n공통 연출 지시\n\n전체 영상에서 갑자기 실사로 변하거나 자연적인 재질이 나타나지 않도록 한다. 모든 인물과 배경, 건축물, 자연물까지 금동대향로와 같은 aged bronze / golden-bronze metal 질감으로 통일한다. 장면과 장면 사이에는 페이드인, 페이드아웃, 디졸브, 갑작스러운 컷을 사용하지 않고 카메라의 실제 이동으로 연결한다. 영화처럼 웅장하고 어두운 분위기를 유지한다.\n\n\n② Kling 영상 생성 프롬프트\n\nSCENE 1 — 금동대향로 → 사냥꾼\nContinue directly from the previous shot, beginning with the body of the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner. The camera smoothly moves toward and enters the incense burner, transitioning naturally into the world inside it. Do not use fade, dissolve or sudden scene changes. Reveal a Baekje hunter riding a horse and shooting a bow. The hunter, horse and environment must appear as aged golden-bronze metal sculptures with the SAME realistic cast-metal texture as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner. Deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn rounded surfaces and realistic casting imperfections. The camera smoothly sweeps past the hunter as if observing a living scene, maintaining continuous cinematic movement. Ultra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, dramatic lighting, monumental atmosphere. NO organic materials, green vegetation, chrome, glossy CGI, colorful materials, cartoon, text or watermark.\n\n\nSCENE 2 — 사냥꾼 → 도공\nContinue directly from the previous shot, where the Baekje hunter is riding and shooting a bow. Keep the camera moving continuously with no cut, fade or dissolve. Smoothly travel away from the hunter and sweep through the Baekje world toward a potter shaping clay by hand. Show the potter naturally working at a traditional pottery workspace, viewed as part of the surrounding scene rather than zooming into the pottery itself. ABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING must have the SAME aged golden-bronze metal material as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner. The potter, pottery, tools, clothing, ground and surroundings are all sculpted bronze-metal with deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn rounded surfaces, engraved details and realistic casting imperfections. No real clay, skin, fabric or organic materials. The camera simply sweeps past the potter and continues naturally toward the next scene. Ultra-photorealistic cast bronze, cinematic historical photography, seamless camera movement, dramatic lighting. NO real materials, green vegetation, chrome, glossy CGI, colorful materials, cartoon, text or watermark.\n\n\nSCENE 3 — 도공 → 백제 마을·시장\nContinue directly from the previous shot, where the bronze Baekje potter is working. Keep one continuous camera movement with no cut, fade or dissolve. The camera smoothly travels past the potter and enters a Baekje village street, naturally sweeping through a lively marketplace. Show bronze-metal Baekje people walking, talking, trading goods and living their daily lives among traditional houses and market stalls. ABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING is made from the SAME aged golden-bronze metal as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner: people, houses, rooftops, stalls, ground, trees and every object. Nothing is organic or natural. Even vegetation is sculpted bronze, never green. Use deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn surfaces and realistic cast-metal imperfections. The camera moves through the village as if physically walking through the scene, gradually passing toward a traditional tiled-roof house. Ultra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, seamless cinematic movement, dramatic lighting. NO real grass, soil, stone, organic material, chrome, glossy CGI, colorful materials, cartoon, text or watermark.\n\n\nSCENE 4 — 백제 여인\nContinue directly from the previous Baekje village scene. The camera smoothly moves toward a traditional Baekje tiled-roof house and passes through the open doorway without a cut. Inside, reveal a Baekje woman preparing her appearance before a bronze mirror. She wears traditional ornaments such as earrings, hair ornaments and bracelets inspired by authentic Baekje craftsmanship.\n\nABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING is made from the SAME aged golden-bronze metal as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner. The woman, house, furniture, ornaments and objects are sculpted bronze, never realistic flesh or fabric.\n\nUse deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn rounded surfaces, delicate engraved details and realistic casting imperfections. Her clothing appears as flowing engraved bronze forms, not real fabric.\n\nThe camera smoothly orbits around the woman, briefly revealing her reflection in the bronze mirror, then moves naturally toward the doorway. Warm amber light creates deep shadows and subtle golden highlights.\n\nUltra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, cinematic historical photography, natural camera movement, monumental atmosphere.\n\nNO realistic skin, real fabric, chrome, polished metal, plastic CGI, cartoon, illustration, text or watermark.\n\n\nSCENE 5 — 문 닫힘 → 궁으로 이동\nContinue directly from the previous shot, where the Baekje woman is visible through the narrow doorway.\n\nThe woman remains still as the traditional wooden door slowly closes by itself. The camera never cuts; it smoothly pulls backward with the closing door, rises above the house and continues forward across the settlement toward a magnificent Baekje royal palace.\n\nABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING is made from the SAME aged golden-bronze metal as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner: ground, houses, rooftops, trees, people, walls, gates and palace. Nothing is organic.\n\nEven vegetation is sculpted bronze, never green. The ground is solid weathered bronze, inspired by ancient Baekje burial mounds, with no real soil or grass.\n\nThe entire world shares one unified aged bronze texture: deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn surfaces and realistic casting imperfections.\n\nAs the camera approaches the palace, descend to an extremely low position and move toward the massive palace gate. Then tilt dramatically upward while moving closer, making the palace tower above the viewer.\n\nThe sky is deep black with soft golden light descending from above.\n\nUse one seamless cinematic movement: closing door → backward camera movement → metallic settlement → low approach → dramatic upward tilt along the palace.\n\nUltra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, cinematic historical photography, seamless camera movement, dramatic lighting, monumental scale.\n\nNO FADE, NO DISSOLVE, NO CUT, NO REAL GRASS, TREES, SOIL, STONE, ORGANIC MATERIAL, GREEN VEGETATION, CHROME, STAINLESS STEEL, GLOSSY CGI, REALISTIC SKIN, COLORFUL MATERIALS, CARTOON, TEXT OR WATERMARK.\n\n\nSCENE 6 — 궁 → 백제 여왕\nContinue directly from the previous shot, facing the monumental Baekje royal palace.\n\nThe camera continuously approaches the massive bronze gate from a low angle. The gate slowly opens by itself, and the camera passes through immediately without stopping or cutting.\n\nKeep moving continuously through the entrance and royal hall. Never pause or create a sudden transition; it must feel like one uninterrupted cinematic journey.\n\nABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING is made from the SAME aged golden-bronze metal as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner: palace, floor, pillars, walls, throne, queen, attendants and every object. Nothing is organic.\n\nAs the camera advances, reveal a majestic Baekje queen seated high upon a monumental throne, looking down toward the camera. Several bronze court officials stand naturally on both sides behind her, forming a formal royal court.\n\nThe queen wears an elaborate crown inspired by authentic Baekje gilt-bronze crown ornaments, entirely recreated in aged golden bronze. Her face, hair, clothing and jewelry are sculpted bronze with engraved details and flowing metallic folds.\n\nThe officials are fully bronze sculptures with detailed ancient court clothing, positioned behind the queen so she remains the focus.\n\nMaintain one unified aged bronze texture: deep dark bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn surfaces and realistic casting imperfections. No polished gold or chrome.\n\nThe camera smoothly passes between the officials toward the throne, gradually rising from a low angle toward the queen. Never stop. End as the queen calmly looks down at the camera with overwhelming authority.\n\nDeep black surroundings and soft golden light illuminate the queen and court with subtle rays and metallic reflections.\n\nUltra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, cinematic historical photography, seamless camera movement, dramatic lighting, monumental atmosphere.\n\nNO REAL SKIN, HAIR OR FABRIC, NO ORGANIC MATERIAL, CHROME, STAINLESS STEEL, GLOSSY CGI, COLORFUL MATERIALS, CARTOON, TEXT OR WATERMARK.\n\n\nSCENE 7 — 여왕 → 궁 밖 → 산 → 5악사\nContinue directly from the previous shot, where the Baekje queen looks down at the camera.\n\nNO FADE, NO DISSOLVE, NO CUT, NO TELEPORTATION. The entire transition must happen through continuous physical camera movement.\n\nThe camera moves closer to the queen, dramatically enlarging her face and crown. Then smoothly moves behind and around her, using her bronze figure as a natural visual transition. Do not make her disappear or fade.\n\nContinue physically through the royal hall, passing bronze pillars and court officials, then move toward the palace gate and smoothly exit outside.\n\nABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING is made from the SAME aged golden-bronze metal as the Baekje Gilt-bronze Incense Burner: queen, officials, palace, ground, mountains, trees and every object. Nothing is organic or natural.\n\nAfter leaving the palace, accelerate across the completely metallic landscape. Fly low over bronze rooftops and ancient terrain, then gradually rise toward distant mountains.\n\nThe entire world has deep aged bronze, muted gold, natural patina, soft oxidation, worn surfaces and realistic cast-metal imperfections. Mountains and vegetation are sculpted bronze, never real stone, soil or green plants.\n\nUse fast, smooth cinematic movement with strong parallax and natural motion blur. The journey must feel continuous: queen close-up → behind queen → palace interior → outside gate → metallic landscape → mountains.\n\nAs the camera approaches the mountains, gradually reveal FIVE Baekje musicians performing together. They are entirely aged bronze-metal sculptures playing traditional instruments. Do not make them suddenly appear; physically approach and reveal them through the landscape.\n\nEnd with a powerful wide view of all five musicians against the metallic mountains as the camera gently orbits them.\n\nThe sky is deep black with soft golden light illuminating the metallic mountains and musicians.\n\nUltra-photorealistic aged cast bronze, realistic metal texture, seamless cinematic camera movement, dramatic lighting, monumental atmosphere.\n\nNO FADE, NO DISSOLVE, NO CUT, NO ORGANIC MATERIAL, NO REAL VEGETATION, NO REALISTIC SKIN, NO CHROME, NO GLOSSY CGI, NO COLORFUL MATERIALS, NO CARTOON, NO TEXT OR WATERMARK.",
