      "promptSummary": "",
      "fullPrompt": "[00-10]\n자색, 검은색, 붉은색, 푸른색, 황색, 흰색의 매듭끈이 물결치며 능선을 \n따라 격자무늬로 엮이며 길어지면서 이동하다, 금서루가 있는 자리에서 땅에서부터 올라가며 금서루 형태로 완성된다. 이때 능선을 포함, 금서루 역시 실제 지형을 배제하고, 매듭이 만드는 형태로 존재한다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트 1]\nStarting from the intricate woven knot-art structure of Geumseoru Gate shown in the reference image, the camera smoothly tilts down and cranes forward over the edge. Below, the dark, stylized surface of the Geumgang River emerges, where thick, luminous golden water mist swirls dramatically in a mystical vortex. The woven knot texture of the fortress remains partially visible in the upper foreground as the glowing river mist fills the lower frame. Cinematic downward tilt, ethereal golden glow, abstract conceptual art, 8k resolution, seamless transition.\n\n[10-16]\n금서루에서 카메라가 아래를 내려다보면 금강에 금빛 안개가 소용돌이친다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트 2]\nCinematic drone aerial shot: Gongsanseong Fortress and rolling mountain ridges intricately woven from traditional Korean knot cords (maedeup) in purple, black, red, blue, yellow, and white forming a lattice pattern. The camera smoothly tracks along the woven cord ridges before elevating into a high-angle overhead shot (bird's-eye view), fully revealing the majestic fortress wall and landscape made of vibrant braided threads. Ultra-realistic fabric texture, subtle thread movements, soft dramatic lighting, cinematic depth of field, 8k resolution.\n\n[16-26]\n금강의 금빛 안개 속에서(첨부 이미지 참조) 은은한 금빛을 내뿜는 황룡이 서서히 모습을 드러내고 금서루를 휘감으며 하늘로 올라간다. \n이때 황룡의 비닐 하나하나가 백제 금속공예의 정교한 결을 띠고 있다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트 3]\nA majestic Imperial Golden Dragon, adorned with intricate, filigreed metalwork textures reminiscent of Baekje gilded bronze art, slowly emerges through swirling golden mist. The dragon coils spirally around the exact architectural pavilion structure shown in the referenced image, carefully preserving its original framework. The structure is constructed entirely from an intricate weave of multi-colored traditional knotted ropes in vivid purple, deep black, rich red, vibrant blue, golden yellow, and pure white. As the dragon surges powerfully upward into the sky around the knotted framework, each golden scale glimmers with delicate, radiant brilliance against the colorful knotted cords. Dynamic upward tracking shot. Sound Design: Epic Gugak orchestration featuring deep, thunderous Korean Buk drums and a massive whooshing roar of turbulent air.\n\n[26-36]\n공산성이 내려다보이는 하늘에 도착한 황룡이 허공을 향해 포효하며 황금빛 \n빛무리를 뿜어낸다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트 4]\nCinematic shot, 8k resolution. Reaching high above the summit of Gongsanseong Fortress, the majestic imperial golden dragon (matching the referenced image) unleashes a thunderous roar into the open sky, unleashing a brilliant burst of divine light. In an epic visual climax, the dragon's entire body, its trajectory, and the fortress outlines burst into hundreds of millions of shimmering, radiant gold particles, scattering explosively across the sky. Dynamic wide-angle camera tracking the upward explosion of light. Sound Design: Powerful climax of thunderous traditional Korean percussion instruments, followed by the deep, crystalline metallic resonance and lingering reverberations of traditional bells and a brass Jing gong.\n\n[36-46]\n허공에 퍼진 금빛 입자들이 불꽃과 식물 덩굴의 궤적으로 그리며 중심부로 모인다. 이때 식물 덩굴은 무령왕릉 금제관식에 새겨진 인동초문의 궤적으로 따르며 불꽃은 화염문의 형태로(첨부 이미지 참고) 마치 춤추듯 정교하게 맞춰지며 거대한 황금빛 금제관식으로 형상화된다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트 5]\nCinematic shot, 8k resolution. Golden particles scattered across the dark sky, reminiscent of the referenced image, reverse direction and converge smoothly toward the center. The sparkling particles trace glowing trajectories: elegant vine tendrils inspired by the Baekje honeysuckle patterns (Indongchomun) from King Muryeong's golden crown ornament, harmoniously dancing and intertwining with soaring, stylized flame motifs (Hwayeommun). The particles assemble with fluid, rhythmic precision into a majestic, glowing Baekje royal golden emblem radiating divine light. Dynamic zoom-in centering on the forming symbol. Sound Design: Mystical and ethereal ambient string orchestra swells with a dreamy, crystalline metallic shimmer.\n\n[46-56]\n완성된 금제관식 실루엣(첨부 이미지 참조) 뒤로 현대 공산성과\n금강의 야경이 오버랩된다. \n\n[AI 변환 프롬프트6]\nCinematic shot, 8k resolution. Starting from the glowing golden crown silhouette (as in the referenced frame), the background smoothly cross-dissolves into a breathtaking night panoramic view of modern Gongsanseong Fortress and the serene Geumgang River illuminated with city lights and reflections. The golden particles softly scatter into the deep night sky, followed by a gentle, poetic fade out to black. Sound Design: A deeply resonant and poignant solo Haegeum melody, layered with the subtle, peaceful whisper of a nocturnal river breeze.",
