      "promptSummary": "",
      "fullPrompt": "📸 [장면 1] 현대의 공산성에서 백제 왕궁이 홀로그램으로 재건되는 순간\nPrompt: A wide-angle, cinematic 8k photograph of the historic Gongsanseong Fortress in Gongju, South Korea. On a peaceful green meadow where ancient ruins used to be, a magnificent traditional Baekje Kingdom palace is magically rebuilding itself. Swirling golden light trails, glowing dust particles, and futuristic holographic blue grids are assembling the wooden pillars, intricate tiled roofs, and grand gates in real-time. Beautiful cinematic lighting, volumetric fog, hyper-detailed architecture, a blending of ancient heritage and futuristic technology. – ar 16:9\n\n📸 [장면 2] 웅진백제 왕궁 내부와 무령왕의 실루엣\nPrompt: Inside the grand royal court of the Baekje Kingdom palace. Elegantly dressed ancient Korean nobles and foreign envoys wearing colorful silk Hanbok are walking through the hall. At the center, on a raised golden throne, the grand silhouette of King Muryeong is radiating a subtle, majestic glow. Warm ambient lighting, detailed wooden textures, traditional lanterns illuminating the hall, highly realistic, 8k resolution, cinematic atmosphere. – ar 16:9\n\n📸 [장면 3] 등불로 가득한 웅진성의 화려한 야경과 금강\nPrompt: A stunning night view of the ancient city of Ungjin (modern Gongju). The traditional streets are bustling with people and lit by thousands of warm, glowing paper lanterns. In the background, the beautiful Geumgang River flows, with traditional wooden merchant ships floating on the water, decorated with lights. Cinematic chiaroscuro lighting, rich colors, a vibrant historical festival atmosphere, hyper-detailed, photorealistic, 8k. – ar 16:9\n\n📸 [장면 4] 과거에서 현재로의 전환의 순간\nPrompt: A panoramic cinematic 8k digital artwork capturing a magical seamless transition. On the left side of the screen, the brilliant lights of the ancient Baekje kingdom city of Ungjin burst into thousands of rising golden firework sparks and glowing ambient dust particles. On the right side, these sparks perfectly morph and dissolve into the modern night view of Gongju city, seamlessly becoming the structural neon lights of the historic Geumgang Bridge and the glowing, illuminated stone walls of Gongsanseong Fortress. Epic lighting contrast, deep night sky, fluid motion blur, hyper-detailed, 16:9 aspect ratio.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n🎥 [비디오 1] 공산성 터에서 왕궁이 시네마틱하게 솟아오르는 타임랩스\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, drone slow dolly-in shot of Gongsanseong fortress meadow. A magnificent ancient Korean Baekje palace is dynamically assembling and rising from the ground. Magical golden light trails and glowing particles warp into traditional wooden structures and tiled roofs. Hyper-detailed architecture, timelapse effect, mystical atmosphere, volumetric lighting.\n\n🎥 [비디오 2] 왕궁 문이 열리며 펼쳐지는 백제 조정의 모습\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, slow panning shot inside the Baekje royal court. Grand wooden pillars, ancient Korean ministers in elegant silk robes walking in slow motion. In the center, King Muryeong's silhouette glows majestically on the throne. Warm ambient light, intricate traditional patterns, cinematic depth of field.\n\n🎥 [비디오 3] 금강 무역선과 웅진성 거리의 활기찬 야경\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, sweeping camera move over ancient Ungjin city at night. Thousands of warm traditional paper lanterns illuminating busy historical streets. On the Geumgang river, glowing wooden trade ships are sailing gently. Vibrant festival night, rich colors, stunning lighting, photorealistic.\n\n🎥 [비디오 4] 불꽃 입자가 현대 공주의 금강철교 야경으로 매끄럽게 바뀌는 장면\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, seamless match-cut transition. Ancient city lights explode into a beautiful swirl of golden sparks and dissolve into the modern night view of Gongju city, revealing the glowing Geumgang Bridge and illuminated fortress walls. Dynamic camera rotation, modern city lights, epic transition.\n\n🎥 [비디오 4] 불꽃 입자가 현대 공주의 금강철교 야경으로 매끄럽게 바뀌는 장면\n• [과거 소멸 컷]\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, slow-motion shot of the ancient city lights of Ungjin bursting into a beautiful swirl of rising golden firework sparks and dissolving into the dark night sky. Mystical and epic atmosphere, 16:9.\n\n🎥 [비디오 5] 불꽃 입자가 현대 공주의 금강철교 야경으로 매끄럽게 바뀌는 장면\n• [현대 생성 컷]\nPrompt: Cinematic 4k video, glowing golden sparks and stardust particles magically assembling into the modern night view of Gongju city, beautifully revealing the neon-lit Geumgang Bridge and illuminated Gongsanseong fortress walls. 16:9.\n\n🎥 [비디오 6] 섬네일\nPrompt: 잔잔한 자연의 바람 소리, 새소리. 현대의 푸른 공산성 안의 빈 성터(만하루와 연지 주변)가 비춰집니다. 조용하고 평화로운 분위기 속에서 부드러운 바람이 붑니다.",
