voice.\nThick, resonant, full-bodied baritone.\nLow to medium-low pitch with strong chest resonance.\nClear professional broadcast diction and firm consonants.\nMedium speaking pace, confident and continuous.\nAuthoritative, composed, dignified and substantial.\nDo not sound like a movie trailer or commercial advertisement.\nKeep sentence endings firm and clean.\nDo not drag vowels or create excessive pauses.\n\nNarration:\n\n<deep, resonant, authoritative>\n한 장의 금판 위에,\n백제의 선이 다시 새겨집니다.\n\n<firm, precise, steady>\n선을 따라 금을 비워내자,\n무령왕 금제 관식의 문양이 모습을 드러냅니다.\n\n<broad, confident, continuous>\n분리된 조각은 공간을 지나,\n비어 있던 자리로 돌아갑니다.\n\n<strong, controlled, building>\n흩어진 금이 다시 하나의 형태가 되는 순간.\n\n<deep, definitive, resonant>\n백제의 금빛은\n오늘 다시 이어집니다.\n\n\n[ElevenLabs 배경음악 프롬프트]\n\nCreate a 31-second instrumental score for a premium Korean cultural heritage film about the reconstruction of a Baekje gold ornament. The music should feel monumental, elegant, luxurious, antique, dignified, and restrained, never fantasy-like or sentimental.\n\nUse a dark cinematic foundation with low strings, deep bowed bass, subtle low brass, sparse geomungo-like plucked textures, refined metallic percussion, and long resonant tones that suggest worked gold and ancient craftsmanship.\n\nKeep the tempo around 70 BPM with no strong drum groove. Begin sparse and low, gradually add tension during carving and separation, then increase depth and scale as fragments travel and assemble. In the final section, broaden the sustained strings and low resonance as the ornament becomes complete.\n\nLeave clear midrange space for a thick Korean male announcer voice. Sound effects must remain clearly audible. Narration is first priority, sound effects second, music third.\n\nInstrumental only. No vocals, choir or chanting. Avoid blockbuster brass, trailer booms, magical sparkles, East Asian fantasy clichés, sentimental piano, EDM, excessive taiko, sudden drops, abrupt transitions and loud final hits. The full 31 seconds must feel like one continuous musical movement.",
