      "fullPrompt": "[작품명]\n향, 1400년의 기억\n\n[전체 콘셉트]\n백제금동대향로를 단순한 유물이 아니라 백제인이 상상한 하나의 세계로 표현한다. 향로에 새겨진 용, 연꽃, 산악, 악사, 동물, 봉황 등의 요소가 실제 공간과 살아 있는 존재로 확장되는 모습을 생성형 AI로 구현한다. 전체 영상은 어두운 공간과 고풍스러운 금빛, 향연과 안개, 따뜻한 빛을 중심으로 구성하며, 신비롭고 장엄한 분위기의 시네마틱 포토리얼 스타일을 유지한다. 중국풍 궁궐이나 일반적인 동양 판타지 건축물은 배제하고, 백제금동대향로의 형태와 조각 요소를 중심으로 표현한다.\n\n[장면 1 - 향로의 등장]\nCinematic photorealistic scene of the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner standing alone in almost complete darkness. A tiny warm ember glows from inside the burner and delicate incense smoke rises in long elegant curves. Antique gilt-bronze surface with realistic aged patina, subtle warm reflections, deep black background, volumetric haze, tiny floating gold particles, sacred and mysterious atmosphere, refined cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed historical fantasy realism, no text.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nPreserve the start image composition and artifact design exactly. Use a very slow forward camera dolly toward the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner. Thin incense smoke rises continuously in graceful curves, warm internal light flickers softly, and tiny golden dust particles drift in depth. Keep the artifact stable and detailed. Do not redesign, deform, melt, or change its proportions. Smooth cinematic motion, no sudden cuts, no text.\n\n[장면 2 - 향로 내부로 진입]\nExtreme cinematic macro view of the mountain-shaped surface of the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner. Ornate ridges, tiny sculpted people and birds, carved peaks and detailed bronze textures fill the frame. Incense smoke flows through narrow gaps and a warm inner glow shines from a deep crevice, making it feel like an entrance to another world.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nThe camera performs a smooth continuous macro push-in through the golden mountain-like relief, as if entering the artifact. Incense smoke flows naturally between carved ridges and tiny figures. Warm light breathes from the central crevice. Maintain the sculptural details without warping. Highly fluid camera movement, cinematic parallax, premium macro realism.\n\n[장면 3 - 조각이 세계가 되다]\nThe carved mountain relief of the Baekje incense burner transforms into a vast living mythical world. Bronze ridges expand into colossal sacred mountain ranges while still echoing the shapes of the artifact. Sculpted birds and animals become living creatures. Incense smoke becomes clouds and mist flowing through valleys. Antique gold highlights, atmospheric blue-gray haze, grand cinematic photorealism, no generic Chinese palace imagery.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nAnimate the vast golden mountain world with elegant fluidity. The camera glides forward and rises slowly through the valley. Thick mist rolls continuously through the mountains, clouds drift through multiple depth layers, and birds glide naturally. Keep the golden mountain forms and overall composition stable. The world should feel like the incense burner relief has become alive.\n\n[장면 4 - 다섯 악사의 깨어남]\nFive ancient musician figures inspired by the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner awaken on sculptural golden mountain ridges. They appear as gilt-bronze figures becoming alive rather than modern actors. Ancient instruments, subtle robes, incense smoke and warm golden reflections. Reverent and magical cinematic historical fantasy.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nThe musicians slowly awaken with restrained lifelike motion. Add gentle head movements, subtle hand and arm movements as they begin to play their instruments, and slight movement in their clothing. The camera makes a slow elegant orbit and gentle push-in. Incense smoke curls continuously around them. No extra limbs, no face deformation, no sudden camera shake.\n\n[장면 5 - 용의 상승]\nA noble mythic golden dragon inspired by the dragon pedestal of the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner emerges from swirling water-like incense smoke beneath the sacred vessel. The dragon is majestic and protective rather than aggressive. Low-angle composition, strong vertical ascent, glowing particles and deep golden light.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nThe dragon slowly comes alive and coils upward with majestic controlled movement. Its whiskers and mane flow naturally while incense smoke spirals around its body. The camera starts low and tilts upward, following the dragon toward the incense burner. Maintain anatomical consistency and bronze-gold texture. Smooth, dynamic and cinematic upward movement.\n\n[장면 6 - ��꽃과 산의 상승]\nA breathtaking vertical ascent through luminous lotus petals into the mountain world of the Baekje incense burner. Giant lotus forms transform seamlessly into gilded mountain ridges and cloud-wrapped peaks. The camera looks upward toward the phoenix at the summit. Flowing incense smoke, mist and celestial warm light.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nCreate one uninterrupted vertical ascent. The camera travels upward through the luminous lotus petals, passes between gilded mountain ridges and continues climbing through drifting clouds toward the phoenix. Keep the lotus and mountain structure consistent with the source image. Add flowing mist, smoke, light rays and golden particles. Elegant vertical parallax and smooth dreamlike movement.\n\n[장면 7 - 봉황의 비상]\nThe phoenix finial of the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner transforms into a living radiant golden phoenix and rises into the sky. Wings spread wide, long elegant tail feathers flow like light and smoke, and glowing incense trails and golden particles stream behind. Emotional cinematic climax.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nThe golden phoenix launches into flight with graceful and powerful movement. Its wings unfold and beat naturally while long tail feathers flow behind. The camera tracks upward and forward with the phoenix. Clouds drift around it and the backlight gradually becomes brighter. Keep the phoenix design consistent. No extra wings, no body warping, no chaotic motion.\n\n[장면 8 - 현재로 돌아오다]\nA quiet modern museum gallery with the Baekje gilt-bronze incense burner displayed inside a glass case under warm focused lighting. A visitor is seen from behind, looking at the artifact. Tiny golden dust and a faint trace of smoke remain as a visual memory of the previous mythical world. Photorealistic and contemplative cinematic ending.\n\n영상화 프롬프트:\nCreate a calm emotional ending with a very slow forward camera movement from behind the visitor toward the artifact. Add subtle reflections on the glass, floating dust particles and a faint trace of smoke. The visitor remains almost still. Keep the museum, artifact and composition realistic and stable. No text.\n\n[공통 스타일]\nCinematic, mystical, sacred, ultra-detailed, dark atmospheric environment, antique gold and bronze, warm subtle light, flowing incense smoke, drifting mist, floating golden particles, smooth cinematic camera movement, photorealistic historical fantasy, Korean heritage inspired, rich depth, immersive visual storytelling, no text, no modern fantasy architecture, no sudden cuts, no excessive distortion.",
