      "fullPrompt": "「밖을 향한 돌짐승 — 무령왕릉 석수, 천오백 년의 눈」 — 2026 디지털헤리티지페스타 AI 헤리티지 공모전 · 동영상 부문 · 생성형 AI 활용 프롬프트 전문\n\n[이미지 · 10장면] 도구: Z-Image-Turbo (Tongyi-MAI · Apache-2.0) · ComfyUI 0.36.0 로컬 실행 · 텍스트→이미지\n공통 파라미터: 1920×1088 · steps 8 · cfg 1 · res_multistep/simple · shift 3 · 최종 1920×1080으로 크롭(상하 4px)\n\n── 장면 01 · seed 220001 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 45분 6초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, 6th-century Baekje kingdom. A quiet funeral procession of people in ancient Baekje robes carrying lanterns climbs a soft pine-covered hill at dusk toward a freshly built round burial mound; a wide river valley and low mountains behind, mist in the valley. Palette: deep indigo dusk sky, terracotta earth, small warm amber lanterns. Solemn, respectful, storybook mood. Empty sky in the upper third. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person\n\n── 장면 02 · seed 220002 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 45분 21초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, interior of an ancient Baekje brick tomb. A long arched tunnel corridor built of terracotta bricks carved with lotus-flower patterns, warm torchlight from small wall niches. In the exact center of the corridor floor sits a stout grey stone guardian beast (jinmyosu): squat heavy body like a small mythical pig-hippo creature, blunt muzzle, short legs, a small branch-shaped iron horn on its head, flame-shaped wing carvings on its shoulders and legs. It faces the viewer, toward the entrance. Palette: terracotta, deep indigo shadow, amber light. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person\n\n── 장면 03 · seed 220013 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 49분 14초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 close-up at eye level. A stout grey stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus sits on a brick floor: rounded barrel body, a blunt rounded snout with faint traces of red pigment on the lips, a large nose, small carved eyes and small ears, short thick legs, smooth weathered grey stone surface, a single slender branch-shaped iron horn rising from the top of its head, shallow flame-shaped carvings on its shoulders and forelegs. It is NOT a lion and has no mane. Behind it, lotus-pattern terracotta brick walls of a tomb corridor in warm torchlight. The creature gazes calmly outward toward the viewer. Ancient, gentle, watchful. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, curly fur, fierce snarling face, dog, feline\n\n── 장면 04 · seed 220014 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 49분 32초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, almost complete darkness inside an ancient Baekje brick tomb after the entrance has been sealed. Only a faint cold blue glimmer outlines the arched lotus-pattern brick ceiling and the low silhouette of a squat stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus with a rounded body, blunt snout, short legs and a single slender branch-shaped horn, sitting in the corridor facing the sealed brick wall. Dust, stillness, centuries passing. Palette: near-black indigo with a single faint blue highlight. Minimal, quiet. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, dog, feline\n\n── 장면 05 · seed 220005 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 46분 4초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, Korea in the summer of 1971, rainy season. On a grassy hillside between old grass-covered burial mounds, a small group of workers in 1970s work clothes and straw hats stand around a freshly dug drainage trench; at the bottom of the trench the top of an ancient arched terracotta brick wall has just been exposed in the wet earth. Overcast sky, light rain, wet green grass, muddy soil. Sense of surprise and discovery. Muted green and grey palette with terracotta accent. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person\n\n── 장면 06 · seed 220016 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 49분 47초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, interior of an ancient Baekje brick tomb corridor at the moment it is opened for the first time in 1,500 years. A strong shaft of daylight pours in from the opened entrance on the left, cutting through drifting dust, illuminating lotus-pattern terracotta bricks. In the center of the corridor floor a stout grey stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus — rounded barrel body, blunt snout, short thick legs, a single slender branch-shaped iron horn on its head, shallow flame-shaped carvings on its shoulders — sits facing directly into the light. Dramatic chiaroscuro, gold light against deep indigo shadow, reverent and breathtaking. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, dog, feline\n\n── 장면 07 · seed 220017 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 50분 3초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean historical concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 medium shot, inside an ancient Baekje brick tomb corridor in soft golden light. Two flat rectangular grey stone tablets lie side by side on the brick floor; the tablets show only fine ruled grid lines and faint shallow scratches that are NOT readable, no actual letters. Behind the tablets sits a stout grey stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus with a rounded body, blunt snout, short legs and a single slender branch-shaped iron horn. Dust motes glow in a beam of light above the tablets. Palette: terracotta bricks, grey stone, warm gold light, deep indigo shadow. Quiet, revelatory mood. No text, no letters, no readable characters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, dog, feline, readable text, characters, calligraphy\n\n── 장면 08 · seed 220008 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 46분 49초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Museum-quality concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9, dark exhibition setting. A pair of thin pierced gold crown ornaments from ancient Baekje float in the center against deep indigo black: each is a flat sheet of gold cut into a flame shape with openwork vine scrollwork and a stem, a flower motif in the middle, tiny round gold spangles hanging on twisted gold wire. They glow warmly, lit from above, casting soft reflections. Elegant, sacred, minimal composition with empty space around. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person\n\n── 장면 09 · seed 220019 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 50분 25초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Digital heritage concept art, cinematic 16:9 wide shot, dark studio space. An ancient Baekje brick tomb corridor is being rebuilt out of light: thousands of glowing amber and cyan particles and thin holographic lines assemble into arched lotus-pattern bricks, half solid terracotta and half luminous wireframe. In the center a stout stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus — rounded barrel body, blunt snout, short thick legs, a single slender branch-shaped horn on its head, shallow flame-shaped carvings on its shoulders — is emerging from the light, its grey stone surface half real and half glowing cyan digital mesh, eyes softly lit. Futuristic yet respectful, deep indigo background. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, dog, feline, large feathered wings\n\n── 장면 10 · seed 220020 · 생성 2026. 9. 19. 20시 50분 41초 (KST)\n프롬프트: Korean concept art, painterly cinematic 16:9 wide shot, present-day Gongju city at night. Foreground: on a grassy hill, a large stout grey stone creature shaped like a small pig-hippopotamus — rounded barrel body, blunt snout, small ears, short thick legs, a single slender branch-shaped iron horn on its head, shallow flame-shaped carvings on its shoulders — sits facing the viewer, softly lit in amber. Behind and below it, the illuminated walls of an old hilltop fortress follow the ridge above a wide calm river, and beyond the river the warm lights of a modern Korean city with apartment towers and a bridge. Clear night sky with a full moon. Peaceful, proud, timeless. Empty sky in the upper third. No text, no letters, no watermark, no logo.\nNegative: text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, caption, subtitles, deformed hands, extra fingers, photo of a real person, lion, foo dog, Chinese guardian lion, mane, fangs, dog, feline\n\n[나레이션 · 10세그먼트] 도구: ElevenLabs (eleven_multilingual_v2 · voice ETPP7D0aZVdEj12Aa7ho · {\"stability\":0.55,\"similarity_boost\":0.75,\"style\":0}) · 텍스트→음성. 입력 문장(=프롬프트):\n01. 천오백 년 전, 웅진의 언덕에 백제의 왕이 잠들었습니다.\n02. 연꽃무늬 벽돌 무덤, 그 통로 한가운데에 돌짐승 하나가 놓였습니다.\n03. 머리에는 쇠뿔, 몸에는 불꽃 날개. 그는 안이 아니라, 밖을 보고 있었습니다.\n04. 문이 닫히고, 천사백 년이 흘렀습니다.\n05. 천구백칠십일 년, 옆 무덤을 고치던 공사 중에 벽돌 하나가 드러났습니다.\n06. 빛이 들어왔을 때, 돌짐승은 여전히 밖을 보고 있었습니다.\n07. 그 앞의 돌판 두 장이 무덤 주인의 이름을 말해 주었습니다. 백제, 무령왕.\n08. 주인과 때를 확실히 밝힌 백제 왕릉은, 이곳뿐입니다.\n09. 오늘, 그 돌짐승이 빛의 벽돌 위에서 다시 깨어납니다.\n10. 천오백 년 왕을 지킨 눈이, 이제 우리를 봅니다. 공주, 무령왕릉.\n\n[음악] 도구: Suno (Pro) · 기존 생성물 재사용 · SORI-AMBI-02__3m54s__8d3598d4.mp3 · 태그 「made with suno; created=2026-07-31T14:07:32Z; id=8d3598d4-fdc7-4a96-9053-9e8af72b1fee」 · 영상용 신규 생성 없음\n\n[대본] 위 나레이션 10문장은 Claude(Anthropic)와 함께 썼다. 사실 관계는 국가유산청 국가유산포털 원문(공주 무령왕릉과 왕릉원 · 무령왕릉 석수 · 무령왕릉 지석 · 무령왕 금제 관식 · 공주 공산성)으로 확인했다.\n[편집·합성] Remotion(코드 렌더 · Ken Burns · 자막) + FFmpeg(후처리) — 생성형 AI 아님.",
