      "fullPrompt": "■ 작품명 : 되감기 (熊津, 1500년의 역발굴 / RE : WIND)\n■ 부문 : 생성형 AI 도구를 활용한 국가유산 재해석 동영상\n■ 사용 도구 : 이미지 GPT Image 2.5 / 영상 Kling 3.0 / 음악 Suno / 나레이션 클로바더빙\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[0] 전 씬 공통 스타일 앵커 (모든 이미지 프롬프트 맨 앞에 동일하게 적용)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\ncinematic film still, anamorphic lens, shallow depth of field, volumetric light and floating dust, fine film grain, muted deep-indigo and antique-gold color grade, Baekje-era Korean heritage, ultra detailed, photorealistic, 8k\n\n[반복 오브젝트 고정 문구]\n· 금제관식 : Baekje royal gold diadem ornament, openwork flame-and-honeysuckle pattern, thin hammered gold sheet\n· 진묘수 : ancient Korean stone guardian beast, squat quadruped, single horn on the head, carved grey volcanic tuff stone\n· 연화문전돌 : grey bricks with lotus-flower relief, barrel-vaulted arch\n\n※ [역재생] 표시 씬은 아래 프롬프트대로 '정방향'으로 생성한 뒤 편집 단계에서 클립을 역재생하였음.\n따라서 해당 씬의 키프레임 이미지는 반드시 '무너지기 전의 온전한 상태'로 생성함.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS1 박물관 진열장 (0:00, 5.0초) [역재생] ※ 이 이미지를 S12에 재사용\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] cinematic film still, anamorphic lens, shallow depth of field, volumetric light and floating dust, fine film grain, muted deep-indigo and antique-gold color grade, Baekje-era Korean heritage, ultra detailed, photorealistic, 8k, a dark museum exhibition hall, one illuminated glass vitrine at the exact center holding a Baekje royal gold diadem ornament with openwork flame-and-honeysuckle pattern, thin hammered gold sheet, no people in frame, perfectly symmetrical frontal wide shot, vitrine centered, one narrow spotlight from above, deep black surroundings, soft gold reflections on the glass\n\n[영상] A single visitor silhouette walks into frame from the left, passes the vitrine and exits to the right. Camera: static shot, no movement. Mood: hushed, reverent, dust drifting in the spotlight.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS2 금제관식이 흙으로 (0:05, 4.0초) [정재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + extreme close-up of a Baekje royal gold diadem ornament, openwork flame-and-honeysuckle pattern, thin hammered gold sheet, resting on dark wet excavation soil, faint golden motes of light already rising from its surface, extreme close-up, centered, macro detail of hammered gold texture, warm gold rim light against deep indigo darkness\n\n[영상] The gold ornament dissolves into motes of golden light that sink down into the dark soil. Camera: very slow orbit to the right. Mood: solemn, weightless, reverent.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS3 1971년 무령왕릉 발굴 현장 (0:09, 4.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + a 1971 archaeological excavation in Korea, workers in old work clothes and helmets standing on a grassy burial mound, the top of a grey brick arch just barely exposed through the soil, shovels and a hand-held flashlight, press photographers at the edge of frame, medium shot, slightly low angle, dusk light with harsh flashbulb bursts, dust in the air, override the color grade: desaturated 1970s documentary film stock, faded sepia, heavy grain\n\n[영상] A worker lifts shovelfuls of soil away and the brick arch beneath is uncovered. Camera: handheld, slight shake, fixed position. Mood: tense, documentary, urgent.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS4 무령왕릉 전돌 아치 (0:13, 6.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + the intact brick-vaulted tomb chamber of King Muryeong, a perfect barrel-vaulted arch built of thousands of grey bricks with lotus-flower relief, completely whole and undamaged, soil walls on both sides, low-angle wide shot looking up into the vault, single warm shaft of light from the tomb entrance, volumetric god rays, deep indigo shadows\n\n[영상] The entire brick arch immediately explodes apart and every brick flies completely out of frame in a spiral. Camera: slow pull-out (dolly backward). Mood: monumental, slow-motion debris, heavy dust.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS5 현실(玄室) 내부 · 진묘수 (0:19, 4.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + the pitch-dark interior of an ancient Korean brick tomb chamber, an ancient Korean stone guardian beast standing deep inside at its original position, squat quadruped with a single horn on its head, carved grey volcanic tuff stone, a flat inscribed stone tablet lying on the floor beside it, close-up on the stone beast, shallow focus, a single cold beam of light from the entrance, near-total darkness elsewhere\n\n[영상] The stone guardian beast slowly walks forward out of the darkness toward the camera. Camera: slow pull-out (dolly backward). Mood: eerie, sacred, dust motes in the beam.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS6 송산리 고분군 (0:23, 3.5초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + a group of large intact grass-covered ancient royal burial mounds on a rolling hillside in Korea, perfectly rounded and undamaged, pine trees along the ridge, aerial wide shot, slightly tilted horizon, low golden-hour sun raking across the mounds, long shadows, thin mist in the valley\n\n[영상] The burial mounds immediately collapse and slump completely flat into bare ground. Camera: slow aerial tilt down. Mood: geological, epic scale, rolling dust.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS7 공산성 성벽 (0:26.5, 6.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + the long intact stone rampart of a Korean mountain fortress winding over a forested ridge above a wide river, fully built and undamaged, pale grey stone blocks, a gate pavilion in the distance, tracking wide shot along the wall, strong diagonal composition, stormy overcast light with one break of sunlight on the wall, wind in the trees\n\n[영상] A long section of the stone wall immediately collapses and all the blocks tumble completely down the slope out of frame. Camera: lateral tracking shot moving right along the wall. Mood: thunderous, slow-motion, huge dust cloud.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS8 금강의 해체 (0:32.5, 3.5초) [정재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + a wide river at dusk in Korea seen from above, a modern concrete bridge and apartment towers along the bank, and already on the water below a small wooden ancient Baekje boat with a single sail, high-angle aerial drone shot, blue hour light, city lights on the water, reflections\n\n[영상] The modern bridge and apartment towers dissolve into drifting blue-gold light particles and vanish completely. Camera: slow aerial descent toward the river. Mood: magical, dissolving, quiet awe.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS9 웅진 도성 (0:36, 3.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + an intact ancient Baekje capital street, rows of whole tiled-roof wooden houses, tall banner poles with cloth banners, an empty dirt road running into deep perspective, no people in frame, crane shot descending over the street, warm late-afternoon sunlight, thin smoke from kitchen fires, dust in the light\n\n[영상] The whole street of tiled-roof houses immediately crumbles and collapses completely into bare ruins. Camera: slow crane descent. Mood: sweeping, cinematic, falling tiles and dust.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS10 왕의 장례 행렬 (0:39, 3.0초) [역재생]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + a royal Baekje funeral procession on a dirt road, a decorated wooden bier carried by bearers in white mourning robes, tall narrow funeral banners fluttering, a long line of mourners, a large grass burial mound far away on the horizon, side tracking shot, the procession filling the frame horizontally, overcast grey light with one shaft of sun, cold wind, dust from the road\n\n[영상] The funeral procession walks steadily along the road toward the distant burial mound. Camera: lateral tracking shot following the bier. Mood: solemn, rhythmic, banners flapping in the wind.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS11 왕의 뒷모습 (0:42, 9.0초) [정재생] ※ 0:46부터 2초간 프리즈 프레임\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[이미지] (스타일 앵커) + a Baekje king seen strictly from behind, dark silk robes and a gold diadem ornament on his headdress, standing before the wooden gate of a royal palace, his face completely hidden, courtiers blurred far in the background, medium back shot, centered, symmetrical gate behind him, soft dawn light from the front so the figure is rim-lit, mist at ground level\n\n[영상] The king stands still and the morning mist drifts slowly past him. Camera: static shot, no movement. Mood: absolutely still, breath-held silence.\n\n※ 무령왕의 용모는 현존 기록이 없으므로 얼굴을 창작하지 않고 끝까지 뒷모습으로만 처리함.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nS12 회귀 (0:51, 8.0초) [정재생] ※ 키프레임은 S1 이미지를 그대로 재사용\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[영상] Dust motes drift slowly in the spotlight above the vitrine. Camera: static shot, no movement. Mood: quiet, final, reverent.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[음악] Suno (Instrumental, 무가사)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\nKorean traditional cinematic orchestral, reversed cymbal swells and reversed piano, daegeum bamboo flute, pyeonjong bronze bells, geomungo, deep janggu drum pulse, slow ominous build, sudden total silence, then a warm orchestral bloom, epic but restrained, instrumental only, no vocals\n\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n[나레이션] 클로바더빙 (국문, 중저음 남성, 속도 -10%)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\n0:10 발굴은, 꺼내는 일이었다.\n0:28 그러나 오늘은, 거꾸로 돌린다.\n0:48 1500년 전 웅진은, 이렇게 살아 있었다.\n\n[엔딩 자막] 되감을 수 있는 것은 시간이 아니라, 기억이다. / 되감기 RE : WIND",
