      "fullPrompt": "Scene 1 무령왕릉, 안개 속에 서다\n스토리 설명\n안개 낀 무령왕릉 봉분과 돌 입구. 오늘의 장소에서 이야기가 시작된다. 잠시 후 입구 안쪽에서 은은한\n빛이 새어나오기 시작한다.\n프롬프트\nUse the attached photo as the exact reference. Keep the grass-covered tomb mound, the stone\nentrance, the path and the camera framing exactly the same. Change only the lighting and\natmosphere into a cinematic dawn: thick champagne-gold glowing mist drifting low over the grass,\nluminous white-gold haze, fine gold dust floating in the air, a pale glowing sky, dark pine\nforest behind, anamorphic lens look, subtle film grain, photorealistic.\n\n\nScene 2 빛을 따라, 금제 장식이 떠오르다\n스토리 설명\n카메라가 입구의 빛 속으로 들어가고, 어둠 속에서 금제 불꽃문양 장식이 홀연히 떠오른다. 장식만 보이고\n주변은 완전한 암전.\n프롬프트\nchange background from black to a single beam of pale champagne-gold light from the upper left,\nluminous white-gold highlights glinting along its edges and tiny hanging spangles, fine\nchampagne-gold dust particles drifting through the beam around it, generous empty dark space on\nboth sides, pure obsidian-black background, soft bokeh dust in the foreground, quiet and sacred\natmosphere, museum-grade macro photography, photorealistic, cinematic\n\n\nScene 3 장식이 뒤집히며, 무령왕릉 내부가 드러난다\n스토리 설명\n금제 장식이 천천히 뒤집히고, 카메라가 뒤로 빠지며 배경에 무령왕릉 벽돌 왕릉 내부가 드러난다. 장식은\n그 공간 속 하나의 기억처럼 자리한다.\n프롬프트\ninterior of an ancient Baekje brick tomb chamber filled with luminous champagne-gold and white\nlight, glowing haze pouring from the center of the vaulted corridor, the barrel-vaulted ceiling\nand brick walls only faintly emerging through the radiant glow, soft light rays, symmetrical one-\npoint perspective facing the back wall, dreamlike and sacred atmosphere, high-key glow,\nphotorealistic, cinematic\n\n\nScene 4 빛이 차오르며, 파편이 떠다닌다\n스토리 설명\n카메라가 계속 뒤로 빠지며 화면이 다시 빛으로 가득 찬다. 작은 돌 파편과 금빛 먼지들이 그 빛 속에\n떠다닌다. 아직은 이 빛의 정체를 알 수 없다.\n프롬프트\nmassive burst of brilliant white-gold light exploding from within the stone, enormous radiating\nlight rays fanning out in all directions, blinding luminous with a golden halo, hundreds of\nglowing white-gold particles and sparks streaming outward, stone fragments flying apart,\nvolumetric light, cinematic lens flare\n\n\nScene 5 그 빛은 석수의 등에서 나오고 있었다\n스토리 설명\n더 뒤로 빠지자, 그 빛이 진묘수(석수)의 등에 갈라진 틈에서 나오고 있었다는 게 드러난다. 근원을 찾은\n절정의 순간.\n프롬프트 ① stone splitting open, brilliant white-gold light bursting from the cracks, small stone fragments\nfloating, glowing dust\n프롬프트 ② massive burst of brilliant white-gold light exploding from within the stone, enormous radiating\nlight rays fanning out in all directions, blinding luminous white core with a golden halo,\nhundreds of glowing white-gold particles and sparks streaming outward, stone fragments flying\napart, volumetric light, cinematic lens flare\n\n\n\nScene 6 틈이, 빛과 함께 서서히 메워진다\n스토리 설명\n석수 표면의 균열이 빛과 함께 서서히 메워진다. 갈라졌던 자리가 다시 매끈한 돌로 돌아온다. 깨어남이\n아니라 치유의 순간.\n프롬프트 ① Extreme macro close-up of the solid, intact weathered stone surface of an ancient Baekje jinmyosu\nguardian beast statue, smooth and unbroken aged grey-green stone, gentle curvature of the ancient artifact, dramatic single-source grazing light emphasizing natural mineral grains, micro-pores, erosion marks, and weathered patina, stone surface smoothly receding into a pure obsidian-black void, cinematic side lighting, extremely shallow depth of field, macro lens photography, subtle\nfilm grain, hyper-detailed, cinematic dark atmosphere, 8k photorealistic\n프롬프트 ② Extreme macro close-up of the weathered stone surface of an ancient Baekje jinmyosu guardian beast statue, deep hairline cracks beginning to spread and branch organically across the aged grey-green stone, the cracks gradually widening with subtle fragments of stone breaking away, brilliant white-gold light glowing intensely from deep inside the cracks as if an ancient energy is awakening within the stone, the inner glow is predominantly luminous white at its core with a warm golden halo softly radiating outward onto the surrounding stone surface, tiny particles of glowing dust escaping from the fissures, diagonal composition with the main crack line running from bottom-left to upper-right, surrounding stone surface receding into a pure obsidian-black void, dramatic single-source lighting grazing across the weathered texture to emphasize every pore, mineral grain, erosion mark and carved detail, strong contrast between the cold dark grey stone and the brilliant white-gold light inside the cracks, extremely shallow depth of field, macro lens photography, cinematic tension, subtle volumetric glow around the fissures, realistic\nstone fragments and debris around the newly formed cracks, photorealistic ancient artifact\ntexture, subtle film grain, hyper-detailed, cinematic dark atmosphere, 8k photorealistic\n\n\n\nScene 7 온전해진 석수, 그 결을 어루만지다\n스토리 설명\n완전히 아문 표면 위로 카메라가 천천히 훑는다. 귀, 갈기, 등의 홈 같은 조각의 디테일이 온전한 모습으로\n드러난다.\n프롬프트\nExtreme macro close-up of the solid, intact weathered stone surface of an ancient Baekje jinmyosu\nguardian beast statue, smooth and unbroken aged grey-green stone, gentle curvature of the ancient\nartifact, dramatic single-source grazing light emphasizing natural mineral grains, micro-pores,\nerosion marks, and weathered patina, stone surface smoothly receding into a pure obsidian-black\nvoid, cinematic side lighting, extremely shallow depth of field, macro lens photography, subtle\nfilm grain, hyper-detailed, cinematic dark atmosphere, 8k photorealistic\n\n\n\nScene 8 어둠 속 석수, 다시 잠들다\n스토리 설명\n완전히 원래 모습으로 돌아온 석수가 검은 배경 속에 홀로 놓여 있다. 위에서 금빛 먼지가 조용히\n흩날리며, 다시 긴 잠에 든다.\n프롬프트\nA weathered stone guardian beast (jinmyosu) sculpture from ancient Baekje Korea, crouched in a\nperfectly centered symmetrical pose, resting alone in an infinite pure obsidian-black void,\nsingle dramatic rim light falling from directly above casting a warm golden highlight along its\nstone spine and carved mane while the rest of the form dissolves into shadow, low camera angle\nlooking slightly upward at the beast, intricate carved stone texture with visible weathering and\nmineral flecks catching the light, tiny suspended dust particles drifting motionless in the light\nbeam, extremely shallow depth of field with the beast in tack-sharp focus and the void falling\ninto soft black, anamorphic lens flare barely visible at the edge of the rim light, cinematic\ndocumentary photography aesthetic reminiscent of a museum artifact reveal, muted warm gold and\ndeep charcoal color grading, subtle film grain, ultra-detailed textures, 8k photorealistic",
