      "fullPrompt": "장면 1 — 폐사를 바라보는 스님\nBegin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts behind the monk as he stands in the ivy-covered ruined gate frame, looking out at the crumbling temple and overgrown stone steps ahead. A golden sunset sinks behind the green mountains, bathing everything in warm amber light. The monk takes one slow step forward onto the path. Vines sway gently in the evening breeze. Determined, hopeful, beginning-of-a-new-era atmosphere. No sound effect — warm silence with distant birdsong.\n\n장면 2 — 지눌 스님 등장\nBegin with the attached image as-is. The monk walks slowly forward on the stone mountain path, staff tapping each step. His grey robes sway gently, prayer beads in one hand. Behind him, misty green mountains and golden sunlight filter through pine branches. The camera holds at a low angle looking up at him as he approaches. No sound effect — just quiet footsteps on stone.\n\n장면 3 — 비웃는 도적들 (대치)\nBegin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts on the front bandit's snarling face and clenched fist, then slowly pans across the laughing, mocking bandits — scarred faces, wild hair, raised blades and spears. They shake with laughter and jeer forward. In the back right, the haloed monk stands still and unmoved, calm eyes watching. Rough, mocking laughter echoing in the dark forest.\n\n장면 4 — 신력 발동 \nBegin with the first image as-is. The camera slowly zooms in on the monk's calm face as blades point at him from all sides, dark storm clouds swirling behind the ruined gate. His golden halo glows brighter, eyes close — then a burst of golden light erupts. Transition to the second image: the monk levitates mid-air, robes and golden energy swirling wildly, eyes glowing white. Below, bandits cower and shield their faces in terror. Light radiates downward like divine thunder. A deep resonant boom followed by a sustained divine hum shaking the ground.\n\n장면 5 — 안개가 소용돌이치며 스님을 감싸는 장면\nBegin with the attached image as-is. Thick swirling fog rolls outward from the glowing monk like ocean waves. The camera slowly rises as the fog spirals around ruined temple pillars and stone ruins. Below, bandits reach up helplessly, half-swallowed by the mist. The monk sits serenely at the center, halo radiating golden light through the white fog. A low, rushing wind swirling like a whirlpool.\n\n장면 6 — 호랑이 떼가 안개를 뚫고 쏟아지는 장면 Begin with the attached image as-is. The lead tiger charges straight toward the camera through swirling fog, golden eyes locked forward. Behind it, four more tigers follow in formation. Bandits on both sides flee in panic among ruined temple walls. A golden light glows behind the temple gate in the background. The lead tiger opens its jaws. Massive tiger roar with bandits' screams echoing.\n\n장면 7 — 안개 속 호랑이 눈빛 + 도적 공포 \nBegin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts on the terrified bandits' faces at the bottom, then slowly tilts up into the swirling fog. Pairs of glowing golden tiger eyes emerge one by one — small ones in the deep fog, then massive burning eyes dominating the top of the frame. The fog shifts and ripples around the striped faces. Deep, layered tiger growls building from a low rumble to a thunderous roar.\n\n장면 8 — 벚꽃 만개한 마곡사 \nBegin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts on pink cherry blossoms in the foreground, petals drifting gently across the frame. It slowly pushes forward along the stone path past a stone lantern toward the dancheong temple hall with a golden Buddha visible inside. Cherry blossoms fill every corner, green mountains and blue sky glow behind. Petals keep falling like soft pink snow. Gentle spring breeze rustling through cherry blossom branches.\n\n장면 9 — 스님이 되살린 절을 바라보는 장면 Begin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts behind the monk's shoulder, then slowly pushes forward past cherry blossoms and colorful flowers, over blue-tiled temple roofs, dancheong halls, a stone pagoda, and a golden Buddha visible inside the main hall labeled 麻谷寺. It rises gently to reveal lush green mountains and a bright blue sky. Petals drift in the breeze. Soft wooden moktak tapping in the distance.\n\n장면 10 — 스님과 호랑이 수묵화 실루엣 \nBegin with the attached image as-is. The monk and tiger stand side by side as dark silhouettes, gazing toward misty blue mountains. Fog swirls slowly around them like ocean waves. The camera very slowly zooms out, making them smaller against the vast mountain landscape. A faint moon glows thrgh the haze above. Peaceful, legendary, timeless atmosphere. A single distant temple bell — \"dong——\" fading into silence.\n\n장면 11 — 전쟁을 피해간 마곡사 \nBegin with the attached image as-is. The camera starts on the bottom — soldiers, tanks, explosions, and fire of the Korean War. It slowly tilts up past the smoke to the center where Magoksa temple stands intact and calm. Continuing upward, the Imjin War rages above — samurai w\nriors, red flags, burning buildings. Yet the temple in the middle remains untouched, war swirling around but never reaching it. Faint mist shields the temple like a protective barrier. No sound effect — an eerie, powerful silence amid surrounding chaos.",
      "processCaptureDriveUrl": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=1b3wJmAfWJJi3hh9g1TVzpS9iv1XNelUQ, https://drive.google.com/open?id=10F6JKHEGOX7-zfiotu33JDw3POwkKGDz, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1La_AKfMRFkQPXAY1ZuIu3VohrJVDMIU-, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1cchwc3kOuvF1ynPF37bZKUKYSUy0Rdgm, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gSXm-sVqabDvQwIlfv7m-Fg23U2jchvz, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1Q0uz6-Sg8tsOWKGQSlBiTe5pCRCJQCKb, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1kIarWsawSuFjqStLlmDwxpoTqR6Bgne_, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1bOek7gp3hcuxXAV4QEXbqx19YYlBt_h5, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1J83DQSL5IjvZI8Ob4YORLhrL-5wbVBJ3, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1ENuqAZ7VURgzMkiH-BENIp3npe8mr0H7",
