      "fullPrompt": "An enormous panoramic sculptural landscape inspired by the Baekje Gilt-Bronze Incense Burner, deconstructed and expanded across the entire frame. Do not depict a single complete incense burner. Transform its mountains, dragons, phoenixes, lotus petals, musicians, human figures and mythical creatures into a dense continuous archaeological relief. Countless fragmented gilt-bronze forms intertwined like an ancient ruined civilization, rising and collapsing into one another. Blackened bronze, aged gold, charcoal-black patina, traces of luminous gold emerging from deep darkness. Sacred, mysterious, archaeological, monumental. Figures partially buried and partially emerging, fragmented bodies and mythical creatures fused with mountains and ruins. Incense smoke and darkness swallowing the forms, suggesting disappearance and memory. Extremely intricate texture, dramatic chiaroscuro, black void background, subtle architectural grid.",
