      "fullPrompt": "[작품명]\n1500년째 수호 중\n\n[1씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA small Baekje Jinmyosu made of green-gray stone, with a compact rounded body, four short legs, large round protruding eyes, a blunt muzzle, oval ears, one branching horn centered between the ears, four small ridges along the back, and a short carved tail.\n\nNight inside an elegant museum gallery with dark charcoal walls, walnut herringbone flooring, warm spotlights, side display cases, and a brick arched passage at the rear. A low black display plinth stands in front of the arch, and on top of the plinth sits a clear closed glass display case.\n\nThe small Jinmyosu is standing inside the closed glass display case.\n\nBegin on the rear wall.\n\nA monumental guardian silhouette fills the wall, but its shape is an exact enlarged projection of the Jinmyosu itself: the same rounded head, blunt muzzle, oval ears, single branching horn, compact body, four short legs, four back ridges, and short tail. The silhouette is clearly recognizable as the Jinmyosu, only enormous and imposing, like the ancient guardian hidden inside this small stone creature.\n\nThe camera slowly tilts downward and pulls back.\n\nThe real small Jinmyosu is revealed standing inside the clear closed glass display case on the black plinth directly beneath its enormous matching silhouette.\n\nHold for a brief quiet moment on the contrast between the huge shadow and the tiny Jinmyosu inside the glass case.\n\nThe Jinmyosu slowly opens its large sleepy eyes, lifts its head slightly, and gives one small cute sleepy yawn.\n\nEnd with both the tiny stone Jinmyosu inside the glass display case and its huge guardian-shaped silhouette visible together in the same composition.\n\nAudio: quiet nighttime museum ambience, faint ventilation, subtle room tone, gentle glass resonance, and a tiny sleepy yawn sound. No background music, no score, no melody.\n\n[2씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA small Baekje Jinmyosu made of weathered green-gray stone stands inside a clear rectangular glass display case on a low black pedestal. It has a compact rounded body, four short legs, large round protruding eyes, a blunt muzzle, oval ears, one branching iron horn centered between the ears, four small ridges along its back, and a short carved tail.\n\nThe museum gallery has charcoal-gray walls, a walnut herringbone wooden floor, glass display cabinets along both side walls, and a brick arch centered on the rear wall. The gallery remains dark at night under restrained warm spotlights.\n\nThe front panel of the glass display case slowly opens.\n\nThe Jinmyosu waits for a brief moment, then carefully steps out of the glass case, reaches the edge of the black pedestal and hops down onto the wooden floor.\n\nIts heavy little stone body settles firmly after landing.\n\nThe camera stays low and slightly to the side, clearly showing the open glass case behind the Jinmyosu and the brick arch ahead.\n\nAudio: gentle glass movement, a small stone landing, quiet nighttime museum ambience. Absolutely no background music, no score, no melody.\n\n[3씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA small Baekje Jinmyosu made of weathered green-gray stone. Compact rounded body, four short legs, large round protruding eyes, blunt muzzle, oval ears, four small ridges along the back, short carved tail, and ONLY ONE branching horn centered between the ears. Never show two horns.\n\nNight inside a museum gallery. Charcoal-gray walls, walnut herringbone wooden floor, glass display cabinets, warm museum spotlights, and a brick arch.\n\nWide cinematic shot. Keep the Jinmyosu small in frame.\n\nShot 1: close low-angle shot of the Jinmyosu’s feet walking slowly across the wooden floor. Each footstep creates a turquoise lotus bloom. Fine golden lines spread from each lotus across the floor.\n\nShot 2: wider side-tracking shot of the full Jinmyosu walking calmly forward at the same slow pace. The lotus flowers and golden lines continue appearing under each step.\n\nShot 3: while the Jinmyosu keeps walking, the museum gradually transforms around it. The wooden floor becomes ancient brick. The glass display cabinets fade away. The museum walls become patterned Baekje brick walls. The warm spotlights become dim golden tomb light.\n\nShot 4: the Jinmyosu naturally arrives inside the ancient Muryeong Royal Tomb passage. The camera widens slightly to show the small Jinmyosu fully inside the solemn brick tomb corridor. The turquoise lotus blooms and golden lines softly fade away behind it, leaving only the quiet ancient tomb space.\n\nEnd with the Jinmyosu continuing a few more slow steps inside the Muryeong Royal Tomb, then gently slowing in the center of the passage.\n\nNo background music. Only slow footsteps, soft magical sounds, and ambient tomb resonance.\n\n[4씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA small Baekje Jinmyosu made of weathered green-gray stone, with a compact rounded body, four short legs, large round eyes, a blunt muzzle, oval ears, one branching iron horn, four small back ridges, and a short carved tail.\n\nThe ancient Muryeong Royal Tomb in the Baekje period. A quiet brick passage leads toward the burial chamber. Patterned ancient bricks, dim warm golden illumination, deep shadows, and a solemn sacred atmosphere.\n\nThe Jinmyosu stands completely still in the center of the tomb passage, facing outward as a silent guardian.\n\nThe camera begins farther down the passage and slowly moves toward the Jinmyosu.\n\nThe Jinmyosu does not walk or play. It remains calm and motionless, watching over the entrance to the royal burial chamber.\n\nNear the end, its head lifts only slightly, revealing the same quiet watchfulness that it still carries centuries later.\n\nEnd on a dignified low-angle view of the Jinmyosu guarding the tomb.\n\n[5씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA small Baekje Jinmyosu made of weathered green-gray stone stands completely still in front of a brick arch. It has a compact rounded body, four short legs, large round protruding eyes, a blunt muzzle, oval ears, one branching iron horn centered between the ears, four small ridges along its back, and a short carved tail.\n\nThe museum gallery has charcoal-gray walls, a walnut herringbone wooden floor, glass display cabinets along both side walls, and a brick arch centered on the rear wall. The room is dark at night under restrained warm museum spotlights. Turquoise lotus patterns connected by fine golden lines are already visible across the floor behind the Jinmyosu.\n\nThe Jinmyosu remains perfectly still and slowly raises only its head.\n\nBehind it, turquoise light with warm golden edges gradually forms an enormous translucent Jinmyosu-shaped presence.\n\nThe giant light figure clearly repeats the small Jinmyosu’s rounded body, four short legs, blunt muzzle, one branching horn, four back ridges, and short tail.\n\nThe small stone Jinmyosu stays completely motionless beneath the enormous luminous form.\n\nThe camera slowly pulls back to reveal the scale difference between the tiny stone Jinmyosu and the towering protective figure behind it.\n\nAudio: deep magical resonance, subtle energy shimmer, and quiet nighttime museum ambience. Absolutely no background music, no score, no melody.\n\n[6씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nA bright peaceful museum gallery in the morning. Soft natural sunlight fills the room and reflects gently across the walnut herringbone wooden floor. Charcoal-gray walls, glass display cabinets along both side walls, a brick arch centered on the rear wall, and a low black pedestal supporting a closed clear glass display case are clearly visible.\n\nInside the closed glass display case stands a small Baekje Jinmyosu made of weathered green-gray stone, with a compact rounded body, four short legs, large round protruding eyes, a blunt muzzle, oval ears, one branching iron horn centered between the ears, four small ridges along its back, and a short carved tail.\n\nThe Jinmyosu is completely motionless like an ordinary ancient artifact.\n\nA young Korean girl rendered in polished high-end 3D animated movie style enters the bright gallery. She has a cute rounded Korean face, expressive large brown eyes, straight black bobbed hair, a yellow cardigan, denim overalls, and white sneakers.\n\nShe notices the Jinmyosu and slowly walks toward the glass display case.\n\nShe stops directly in front of it and looks at the Jinmyosu with quiet curiosity.\n\nThe Jinmyosu remains completely motionless.\n\nEnd with the Korean girl and the Jinmyosu facing each other through the glass.\n\nAudio: bright morning museum ambience, soft footsteps, and quiet room tone. No background music, no score, no melody.\n\n[7씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nMorning inside the same museum gallery. Soft natural daylight fills the quiet space. The same charcoal walls, walnut herringbone wooden floor, side display cases, rear brick arch, black pedestal, and closed glass display case remain unchanged.\n\nThe small green-gray stone Baekje Jinmyosu stands completely still inside the closed glass case.\n\nA little Korean girl with straight black bobbed hair, a yellow cardigan, denim overalls, and white sneakers walks into the gallery, notices the Jinmyosu, and comes close to the glass case.\n\nBegin with a close-up at eye level of the girl and the Jinmyosu facing each other through the glass.\n\nEverything is still for a quiet moment.\n\nThen the Jinmyosu blinks once. Only the eyes move. The stone body remains completely motionless.\n\nThe girl freezes in surprise and softly reacts in Korean.\n\nThen a warm, amazed smile slowly appears on her face.\n\nThe Jinmyosu is already perfectly still again, looking exactly like an ordinary ancient artifact.\n\nNo background music. Use only quiet museum ambience, soft child breathing, tiny blink sound, and subtle room tone.\n\n[8씬]\nPolished high-end 3D animated movie style.\n\nMorning inside a bright, peaceful museum gallery.\n\nA young Korean girl with straight black bobbed hair, a yellow cardigan, denim overalls, and white sneakers stands very close to a closed glass display case, only about one step away from it.\n\nInside the glass case is the small Baekje Jinmyosu.\n\nShow the scene from a slightly distant wide shot, but keep the girl and the glass display case visually close together in the center of the composition.\n\nThe girl remains completely still, quietly looking through the glass at the Jinmyosu.\n\nThe Jinmyosu also remains completely motionless like an ordinary ancient artifact.\n\nThe camera remains still.\n\nHold this quiet composition for the entire shot.\n\nNo background music. Only soft morning museum ambience.\n\n[9씬]\nStart from a completely pure black screen.\n\nAnimate the exact Korean title text:\n\n\"1500년째 수호 중\"\n\nThe screen must remain fully black at the beginning.\n\nThen the Korean title should be written rapidly across the screen in bold traditional Korean brush calligraphy, as if an invisible brush is writing it live in quick, powerful strokes.\n\nThe writing animation should feel fast, sharp, and rhythmic, like 착, 착, 착, 착, with each brush stroke appearing one after another in quick succession.\n\nUse large white Korean calligraphy centered on the black screen. The brush lettering should feel elegant, traditional, and powerful, with natural brush texture.\n\nDo not add any illustrations, seals, logos, borders, ink splashes, or extra graphics. Show only the black background and the animated Korean calligraphy title.\n\nAfter the full title is written, keep the text completely still on the black screen for a few seconds.\n\nNo background music. Use only subtle brush-writing sound effects.",
      "processCaptureDriveUrl": "https://drive.google.com/open?id=1KJTmeckXpjQ0uAFli3z9K2psEiP2zBDa, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1fJPr9Ot5XjqNo9Dd0POPlAlBC4h5F4tx, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1bkEv_B1GBrLifxNfJ5a40gk1fXpoT14p, https://drive.google.com/open?id=1IKg_z8QjvkGxTW0Mj9ZqjQfTmcYb--gt",
