y slight slow push-in, exactly as in the end image; one continuous smo…\n[컷 16] Kling 3.0: Camera: telephoto on a tripod with a very slight slow drift, looking past the sheer curtain through the window…\n[컷 20] Kling 3.0: Camera: locked low angle, very slight push-in; never a frozen frame. Motion: behind the lit upper-floor window…\n[컷 21] Kling 3.0: Camera: 85mm on a tripod with a very slow push-in; never a frozen frame. Motion: nothing moves except the colo…\n[컷 22] Kling 3.0: Camera: 35mm lens low above the ground, locked on a tripod with a very slow push-in of about 3 percent; never…\n[컷 26] Kling 3.0: Camera: locked off on a tripod, a straight-on front view of the small shop, with a very slight slow push-in; n…\n[컷 23] Kling 3.0: Camera: locked, with a slow push-in; never a frozen frame. Motion: the pale grey stone beast, seen from behind…\n[컷 24] Kling 3.0: Camera: 35mm on a tripod with a very slow, smooth push-in toward the beast; never a frozen frame. Motion: the…\n[컷 25] Kling 3.0: Camera: a very slow, steady dolly push-in toward the stone statue, ending about 7 percent closer, exactly as i…\n\n※ 글자 한도 때문에 프롬프트 전문(92건, 원천 스틸·정본 시트·문양·소리 포함)은 별도 파일 '진묘수의새벽당직_프롬프트기록.pdf'로 첨부합니다.",
