      "fullPrompt": "1. 고요한 시작 — 가면 속의 고민\n스토리\n해 질 무렵, 고요한 전통 마을의 마당. 홀로 서 있는 탈춤꾼은 고개를 숙인 채 움직이지 않는다. 주변에는 아무도 없고, 바람만 옷자락을 흔든다. 탈춤꾼이 천천히 고개를 들며 춤을 시작하려 한다.\nA solitary Korean traditional talchum dancer wearing a traditional wooden Korean mask and muted ivory hanbok stands in an empty old Korean village courtyard at dusk, head lowered, gentle wind moving the long sleeves and fabric, subtle dust floating in the golden twilight, melancholic and poetic atmosphere, slow cinematic dolly in toward the dancer, realistic traditional Korean architecture, authentic Korean folk culture, dramatic natural lighting, highly detailed cinematic film, 16:9, no text, no subtitles.\n2. 첫 발걸음 — 용기를 내다\n스토리\n북과 장구 소리가 들려온다. 탈춤꾼이 한 발을 힘차게 내딛고 어깨를 들썩인다. 팔을 크게 펼치며 망설임을 떨쳐내고, 발을 구를 때마다 마당에 황금빛 먼지와 꽃잎이 흩날린다.\nThe same Korean traditional masked talchum dancer suddenly begins a powerful joyful traditional Korean mask dance, stamping feet firmly on the ground, swinging both long sleeves dramatically, energetic shoulder movements, golden dust and delicate flower petals swirling around with each step, warm sunlight breaking through clouds, dynamic low angle camera orbit, authentic Korean folk dance choreography, cinematic motion, vivid colors gradually emerging, uplifting atmosphere, realistic flowing fabric, 16:9, no text.\n3. 만남 — 혼자에서 함께로\n스토리\n주인공의 춤을 본 또 다른 탈춤꾼들이 하나둘 마당으로 들어온다. 처음에는 서로 다른 동작을 하지만, 점점 서로의 손짓과 발걸음에 맞춰 함께 춤추기 시작한다.\nSeveral Korean traditional talchum masked dancers in colorful authentic hanbok enter the same village courtyard and join the original ivory-clad masked dancer, different dancers with traditional Korean masks, joyful synchronized traditional Korean dance, exchanging welcoming gestures and raising their sleeves, forming a growing circle, camera smoothly pulls back into a wide shot, warm sunlight, vibrant traditional Korean colors, cinematic celebration of unity and friendship, authentic Korean folk performance, 16:9, no text.\n4. 절정 — 함께 만드는 웃음\n스토리\n북소리가 절정에 이른다. 모두가 원을 그리며 힘차게 춤을 추고, 하늘에는 꽃잎과 색색의 천이 흩날린다. 마을 사람들도 박수를 치며 춤에 동참한다. 마당 전체가 축제의 공간으로 변한다.\nA spectacular joyful Korean traditional talchum festival reaches its climax, dozens of Korean masked dancers and villagers dancing together in a large circle in a beautiful traditional Korean village courtyard, energetic synchronized foot stomping, spinning colorful hanbok sleeves, vibrant silk ribbons and flower petals flying through the air, villagers clapping and laughing, camera rapidly circles around the dancers and cranes upward to reveal the entire celebration, golden sunlight, vivid festive colors, breathtaking cinematic wide shot, joyful unity and hope, 16:9, no text.\n5. 새로운 시작 — 웃음은 이어진다\n스토리\n춤이 멈추고, 모두가 하늘을 향해 두 팔을 펼친다. 주인공은 관객을 향해 고개를 숙여 인사하고, 다시 고개를 들며 밝은 햇살 속에서 웃음이 느껴지는 표정을 짓는다. 마지막에는 화면이 밝아지며 메시지가 등장한다.\nThe same ivory-clad Korean traditional masked dancer stands at the center of a joyful group of colorful traditional Korean masked dancers, everyone performs a graceful final pose with arms spread wide toward the rising sun, the main dancer bows gently to the audience then lifts their head proudly, warm morning sunlight floods the traditional Korean village courtyard, petals slowly drift down, camera slowly pulls back to reveal the peaceful beautiful village, emotional hopeful cinematic ending, authentic Korean talchum, soft golden light, 16:9, no text, no subtitles.\n캐릭터 이미지 프롬프트\nFull body character design of a Korean traditional talchum masked dancer, authentic Korean traditional wooden mask, ivory white hanbok with flowing oversized sleeves, traditional Korean fabric belt, black traditional Korean shoes, elegant and expressive silhouette, slightly stylized cinematic realism, neutral standing pose, front view, entire body visible, plain warm beige background, detailed traditional Korean costume, consistent character design, no text, 16:9",
